<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Maleke</para>
  <para style="toc1">Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi Nii Maleke Sɛʋɛni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maleke</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nii Maleke Sɛʋɛni</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Maleke ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ɠa ga Minazeɠe Niinɛi zu zɛʋɛ naanigɔiti gila, niiti ti Yesu Kilista ná-eteai zu vaiti suɠulazu. Ti ɠilagilagiti pɛ ti-laasei ka ga «Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi». Ti zɛʋɛʋɛ Yesu ná-saai ʋoluma, ti-zɛʋɛ nuiti ta ga: Matiyo, Maleke, Luke ta Zan. Maleke ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ɠa suɓuɠaai Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔ naanigɔiti saama. Tanisu toɠa ɠɛ sɛʋɛni kona ʋuulɔzita (60) ɠɛɠala leʋegai ma, Kilista zɔlɔɔga ʋoluma. Faaɠwɛ nu mɔinmɔin daaʋɛ da ga sɛʋɛʋɛ Wɔlɔme, nii a kɛ é náʋɛ ɠeletiɛinti iɲɔdɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maleke laaseigi ta ɓalaa ka ga Zan Maleke, é ɠɛni ga keelai Pɔle ta Ɓalanaɓase ti-ziɛɲɔɠɔi ta, kɛlɛ tɔɠɔ ʋagɔi ɠoloɠoloni siɛgi zu é ɠɛlɛni naati ta-ɠeela ziɛi ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">KKw 13:13</ref></char>). Suɠoozaai ma, Maleke ʋilɛni ʋolu Ɓalanaɓase ʋolu, ti li siɛi ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">KKw 15:37-39</ref></char>). Nuiti ti kwɛɛni ɓalaa ga Maleke ɠɛni ga Piyɛlɛ bɔɔla ɠiteɠitegi ta (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:13">1Pi 5:13</ref></char>). Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi nii zu, Maleke laaɓakpagɛ kaladopoi losuʋɛ ma, ta kalagi Yesu bogai é lo yeeɠɛɠala ɠaaɓelagi ʋa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Maleke ná-woo lɔɔzei mɔungi bogɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1:1-13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Naa ʋoluma Maleke Yesu ná-botii ma vaa zuɠulaʋɛ, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni la Galilé (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:14-8:21">1:14—8:21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. É zɛba é Yesu lii vai zuɠula Zeluzalɛme (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 8:22-10:52">8:22—10:52</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Maleke gaaɓelagɛ ga é sɛʋɛi ɠɛ, é lo yeeɠɛɠalai ʋa, nii Yesu kɛɛni Zeluzalɛme, naa ʋɛɛ ná-saai ta buzeɠe vai ʋa, é ɠula saai ya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 11:1-16:20">11:1—16:20</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">GALA keelai Zan Ɓatisete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matiyo 3:1-12</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luke 3:1-18</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Zan 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Ʋele ɠa Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi lɔɔzeiɗai la, nii pilɛgai GALA Doun Zunui Yesu Kilista ʋa. <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Ʋelei sɛʋɛai la GALA goo wo nui Ezayi ná-sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">«Nà nà-keelai leʋesu è luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">é ɗa-ʋelei ɓɛtɛ è ʋɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>Nui ta ɠa ɓainsu teʋebai zu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">‹À Maliɠii ná-pelei ɓɛtɛ bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">À ná-pele goiti sɔle.› »<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Eza 40:3</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>Zan ɠulani kɛlɛma ɠana. É ɠɛni ɓatizei wosu teʋebai zu. É ɠɛni GALA daawooi laazeelizu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «À wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo, wo ɓatize, naa ɠa a kɛ wo zuvaayɛ ga wa-ɠotoiti.» <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Nuiti ti ɠɛni ʋaazu pɔ, ti zeɠe Zudé yooi zu ná pɛ, ta Zeluzalɛme, é ɗa ti ɓatize Zuludɛn wu, ti ɗa laa zɔ ga ga ta-ɠotoiti.<verse eid="MRK 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Zan ɠɔba zeɠei ɠɛni ga seɠei fɛlɛai ga ɲɔmɛ leɠai, ná-saamaɠiligi ɠɛni ga kɔlɔ ʋaai. Kɔnɔgi ɠɛni ga kotogi ta dɔɓɔ ɠɔin gulɔi. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Zan ɠɛni GALA daawooi laazeelizu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Zɔi é ʋaazu nɔ̀un poluma, sɛbɛi wɔɔlɔʋɛ nɔ̀nɔi ʋa. Gè la vɔlɔ kula ɠɛɛni su ga gè ʋa maaʋɛ, gè ʋa ná-saʋala galuiti daavie. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Nɔ̀un, gè wo ɓatizegɛ ga ziɛi, kɛlɛ tɔun, toɠa wo ɓatize ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓatize fai ta tɛgai é zeelini ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Matiyo 3:13—4:11</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luke 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Yesu zeɠeni Galilé yooi zu, Nazalɛte taazuʋɛ. Zan kpatizeni Zuludɛn ɗɛi wu. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Kulaai ma ziɛi wu feya, é geeɠɔlɔgi ɠaani daa ɗa lao, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɗa yei ma, eɠɛ poopogi. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Wooi ta ɠulani geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa è ga nɛ̀ɛbɛ Loun Zunui, ɗa gòla yiilaazu.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Gaamago, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai Yesu laaʋilini teʋebai zu. <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>É kɛɛni ná ga folo ʋuunaanigɔ (40), Setana ɠɛni tɛɛzu ga. É ɠɛni ná dɔɓɔ zuaiti saama, geezuɠeelaiti ti ɗa maaleʋebo.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-botii lɔɔzei vai Galilé</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matiyo 4:12-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luke 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Ti Zan ʋiligai ma kasoi ɠa, Yesu liini Galilé yooi zu, é ɠɛni GALA ná-Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelizu. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>É ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Yeeɠɛɠalai zeelia, GALA ná-masadai maaɓuɠaa. À wo-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo, wo la Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi la.»<verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-kaladopo mɔungiti toli fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matiyo 4:18-22</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luke 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Yeeta, tɛi é ɠɛni leʋesu Galilé ɗɛ wolai laaʋɛ, é Simon ɠaani ta kɛɛɠɛloin Andelé. Ti ɠɛni kale ɓɛɛ lumɔi ʋilisu ziɛ wolai wu, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni ga kale ɓɛɛ nuiti. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «À ʋilɛ pòlu, nà wo ɠɛ ga nu ɠaiziɛ nu.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Gaamago, ti ta-lumɔiti zɛni ná, ti ʋilɛ polu.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Yesu lago liini poun, é Zeɓedé ná-doun zunu felegɔiti ka: Zake ta kɛɛɠɛloin Zan. Naati ti ɠɛni keingi zu, ti ɗa ta-lumɔiti kpɛtɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>É naati tolini gaamago. Naati ti ti-ɠɛɛ Zeɓedé yɛni keingi zu ta ná-botiɠɛ nuiti, tiya ma ti ʋilɛ Yesu ʋolu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu inɛ su nui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luke 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Ti liini Kapɛɛlɛnawume taazuʋɛ. Dooɠo foloi, Yesu lɛɛni GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, é zɛba é ɗa kalagi wo. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Nuiti ti wola laavɔɔni ga ná-kalabo pelei, tɔɔzei é la ɠɛni kalagi wosu ga tɔ kalamɔinti kɛʋele, kɛlɛ é ɠɛni bosu ga zobogi.<verse eid="MRK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Tama naama yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ zu, zunui ta ɠɛni ta-ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, nii kɔzɔba yɛnvui ɠɛni su. É kpeei looni, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>é ɠɛ ma: «Nazalɛte nui Yesu, ɗa-vaa ɓɛgele ɠa é gá-vaa zu? È ʋaaʋɛ gi undaaʋilisu ɓaa? Gè è ɠwɛni, ɗa ga GALA ná-Nu Ɲadegai!»<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Yesu devei veeni zea ga sɛbɛi, é ɠɛ ma: «É vɔ, ɠula zunui tɛi su!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Kɔzɔba yɛnvui zunui ɲiikpini. É ɠulani naa zu, é ɗa kpee wolai loo. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ daavɔɔni, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga: «Lee ɠa é ɠɛɛzu ɠani? Kala niina ɠa ga nii! Toɠa kɔzɔba yɛnvuiti devezu ga zobogi, naati ti ɗa ɠolo bɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Gaamago nɔ, maawooi ziɛni ná maaɠoolii pɛ su, Galilé yooi zu.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu seeɓɛ nu mɔinmɔin kɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matiyo 8:14-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luke 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Yesu ɠulaai ma GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu, tɔ ʋe, Zake ʋe ta Zan ti liini Simon ta Andelé ta-ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Simon mɔɛin ɠɛni laani ga kɔlɔkpadimai. Yesu unkulani nɔ feya, ti ná-fai zuɠula naa ma. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Yesu maaɓuɠani ba, é so zeei ʋa, é buzeɠe. Kɔlɔkpadimai ɠaayei, é tɔɔzei ga é ɗa ti maaleʋebo.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Kpɔkɔi, foloi liai ma, ti ʋaani pɔ ga seeɓɛ nuiti pɛ, ta inɛ su nuiti pɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>Taai ɓusɛni nɔ kpulu, ti ʋa, ti ʋu pɛlɛlaʋɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>É seeɓɛ nu mɔinmɔin kɛdɛ, niiti seeɓɛ laalitaaligiti ti ɠɛni ti ʋa. É inɛ mɔinmɔin kpɛɛni ɓalaa, é ɗa pele leʋe ti luɠɔ ga ti mina kpɔɛzuɠula, tɔɔzei naati ti ɠɛni kwɛɛni nui ma zii nii é le.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu GALA daawooi laazeeli vai <optbreak/> GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luke 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Polumai, gosu ɓidii nɔ ɠɛni de, é ɠula, é li teʋebai zu, é GALA fali ná. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Simon ta bɔɔlaiti ti ʋilɛni, ti ɗa gaiziɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>Siɛgi zu ti kaani la, ti ɠɛni ma: «Ɛsɛ pɛ ka è ɠaiziɛzu.»<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Ade li ʋɛ ɠoba laaiti su. Kɛni gè GALA daawooi laazeeli náti. Tɔɔzei naa ɠa é kɛa gè ʋaa.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Tama é leʋeni Galilé yooi zu ná pɛ, é ɗa GALA daawooi laazeeli ta-ƓALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, é ɗa inɛgiti kpɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu gee nui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matiyo 8:1-4</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luke 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Gee nui ta maaɓuɠani ba, é nɔkɔ kɔɠɔwu, é maanɛɛnɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Ni ɗa vaana bu, ɗa zoo è ɲàde.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Maawɔin Yesu zoni, é yeemaale, é vɔɔɠu ba, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè vaa bu, ɲade!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Gaamago nɔ, gee zeeɓɛi zeɠeni zunui naa ʋa, é ɲade. <verse eid="MRK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>É tɛnɛni ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛ, é teʋe gaamago, <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/>é ɠɛ ma: «Dama, nii kɛai ga ɗe ʋɛ, è mina bo nu nɔpɛ ma. Kɛlɛ li, è ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui, é è ɠɛʋele ʋɛtɛ, naa ʋoluma è ɗa-ɲade fai ma zalaɠai ɠula, eɠɛʋelei Moize ma levei veeni la. Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga zeele woo nuiti bɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Kɛlɛ zunui naa ɠulani nɔ feya, é tɔɔzei ga naa laazeelia ɛsɛ pɛ ma, nii kɛai. É ma wooi vazani adaʋɛ pɛ. Naa maaʋele ma, Yesu la mɔ ɠɛni zooga é ʋa lɛ taa nɔpɛ su kalakalaga, é ɠɛni liizu kamaʋolu teʋebaiti su. Kɛlɛ anɛɛ naa ʋe, nuiti ti ɠɛni zeɠezu adaʋɛ pɛ, ti ɗa ʋa pɔ.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kɔlɔsama nui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matiyo 9:1-8</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luke 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Foloi tanigaa ɠulaai ma su, Yesu ɠaleni ma Kapɛɛlɛnawume. Nuiti ti mɛnini ga toɠa pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Bɛbɛ wolai ɠaalɛɛni ba ná, ti yɛ mɔinzu, nu losu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛni ná, anɛɛ pɛlɛlaʋɛ ɓɔɠɔi. Yesu ɠɛni ná, é ɗa GALA daawooi laazeeli ti ma. <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>Nui tanigaa ti ʋaani pɔ ga kɔlɔsama nui ta, seɠeai zunu naanigɔ ʋɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni zooni ti ʋa zeeli la Yesu ma, tɔɔzei bɛbɛi mɔin ʋelei ʋa. Ti zɛba ti lɛ pɛlɛ ɠɔmaʋɛ, ná ga dooɠo bosuʋɛ, ti ná ta ʋaaleʋe, é zoloo nɔ Yesu letegi ma tein, betei nii kɔlɔsama nui ɠɛni laani su, ti naa yei. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Yesu ta-ɠidaaleʋei ɠaai ma, é ɠɛni kɔlɔsama nui ma: «Dòun, ɗa-ɠotoiti suvaayɛga.»<verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Tama, tɔ kalamɔin tanigaa ti ɠɛni zeini ná, naati ti ɠɛni ɠisiɛzu yiimaʋɛ, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>«Lee vaa zu zunui nii zoosu é ɗa ɓɔɛ ɠani? Woo ɲɔu ɠa ga nuu é bosu GALA daalɔɠɔma! Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo kotoiti suvaayɛsu, é ɠula GALA gila kpe polu?»<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Gaamago Yesu ta-ɠisiɛi ɠwɛɛni yiimaʋɛ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo ɠisiɛzu ɠana wo-yiimaʋɛti? <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/>Ɓɛgele ɠa boda nɛai, nu ɠɛ kɔlɔsama nui ma: ‹Ɗa-ɠotoiti suvaayɛga,› ɓaa nu ɠɛ ma: ‹Wuzeɠe, è ɗa-ʋetei zeɠe, è ziɛ›? <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/>Wa ma, wa kwɛɛ ga nii maaʋele ga zobogi ɠa Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋɛ zooi ma ga é kotoiti suvaayɛ.» É ɠɛni kɔlɔsama nui ma: <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/>«Ɗa ɠa gè ɓɔɛzu è ʋɔ, wuzeɠe, è ɗa-ʋetei zeɠe, è li ɗa-ɠoizu.»<verse eid="MRK 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Gaamago nɔ, zunui naa wuzeɠeni, é ná-betei zeɠe, ɛsɛ pɛ gaazuyɛ ba, é ɠula, é ɗa li. Ɛsɛ pɛ daavɔɔni, ti ɗa lɛbiyai ve GALA bɛ, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Kaipa ade la dɛ nii ɠɛɠala vai ta ɠaani.»<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Levi loli fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matiyo 9:9-13</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luke 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Yesu liini mɔnɔ ga ziɛ wolai laa ʋelei. Bɛbɛiti ti ɠɛni daaɠomisu, é ɗa naati kala. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Siɛgi zu é ɠɛni leʋesu la, é Alefé ná-doun zunui Levi ɠaani, é zeini mulu zo nuiti ta-wotii ɠɛɛzuʋɛ. Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Ʋilɛ pòlu!» Levi wuzeɠeni, é ʋilɛ polu.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Tɛi Yesu ɠɛni laamiizu Levi ná-pɛlɛi wu ta ná-kaladopoiti, mulu zo nu mɔinmɔin ta kotoba nu mɔinmɔin ti ʋaani, ti ɗa laami ta tiye, tɔɔzei ti wola mɔinni, ti ʋilɛ polu. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Tɔ kalamɔin niiti ti Faliziɛinti ta-ɠuɠui zu, naati ti kaai ma ga Yesu ɠa daamii wosu ta mulu zo nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kotoba nuiti ba, ti ná-kaladopoiti gaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu ti daamii wosu ta mulu zo nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kotoba nuiti ba?»<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Tɛi Yesu ti woomɛnini, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Zɔiti ti ɠɛdɛgai, naati kpɛdɛ la ɗɔɠɔtɔlɔi ʋa, kɛni seeɓɛ nuiti. Gè la ʋaani ga gè telebo nuiti toli, kɛni kotoba nuiti.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zu so fai ma ɠaazaɠagi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matiyo 9:14-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luke 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Yeeta Zan ná-kaladopoiti ta Faliziɛinti ti ɠɛni zugi zosu. Nui tanigaa ti ʋaani, ti Yesu ɠaazaɠa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu Zan ná-kaladopoiti ta Faliziɛinti ta-ɠaladopoiti ti ɗa zugi zo, tama ɗa-ɠaladopoiti ti la ɗa ga so?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Nuiti ti loligai vulu ɠɛɛzuʋɛ, ta zoo ɓaa ti zugi zo, siɛgi zu anzazini niinɛi ti ʋa la dɛ? Ni anzazini niinɛi ɠa dɛ ti ʋa, ti la zooga ti ʋa zu so. <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/>Kɛlɛ yeeɠɛɠalai ta ɠa ʋaazu, siɛgi zu ta anzazini niinɛi zeɠe la ti ʋa. Názu ta zugi zo niina.»<verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>«Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɗa ga seɠe zaɠai zulaɠaga ga seɠe ɓuɠa niinɛi. Naa ɠa ɠɛɛna, seɠe ɓuɠa niinɛi ɠa seɠe zaɠai ʋali ga, naama ʋaligai zu ɠa ɗa ɓaɠo ma mɔungi ʋa. <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/>Nu la ɗa ga dɔɔ niinɛi ʋu ɓalaa kɔlɔ woole wɔlɔmaiti su. Naa ɠa ɠɛɛna, dɔɔ niinɛi ɠa kɔlɔ woole wɔlɔmaiti fuka, dɔɔi ɠa ʋu ya, gooleiti ɓalaa ti ɠoloɠolo. Dɔɔ niinɛi maanɛɛʋɛ, é ʋu kɔlɔ woole niinɛiti su.»<verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠa ga dooɠo foloi Maliɠii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matiyo 12:1-8</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luke 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Yeeta, dooɠo foloi, Yesu ɠɛni leʋesu molo ɓalagiti su. Ná-kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni ziɛzu, ti tɔɔzeini ga ti ɗa molo ɠɔpɔgiti gaaʋolososo. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Faliziɛinti ti ɠɛni ma: «Wɛlɛna ɗa-ɠaladopoiti ba! Lee vaa zu ti naa ɠɛɛzu, nii tɔgi la vaani bu ga nu kɛ dooɠo foloi?»<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Kaipa wo la dɛ naa ɠalani, nii Davide kɛɛni, siɛgi zu pului soni da ta siɛɲɔɠɔiti, tama daamiani ge la ti ya?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛ: <char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 21:2-7">1Sa 21:2-7</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/>É lɛɛni GALA ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai wu, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Aɓiataal ná-yeeɠɛɠalai, é ɓuluiti mi, ti veai GALA bɛ, é ta ve siɛɲɔɠɔiti zea, tama tɔgi deveni ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti gila kpe nɔ ɠa ta ɓului naati mi.» <verse eid="MRK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Naa ʋoluma, Yesu ɠɛni ti ma mɔnɔ: «Dooɠo foloi ɓɛtɛʋɛ nui vaa ma, kɛlɛ nui la ɓɛtɛni dooɠo foloi vaa ma. <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa vɔlɔ é ga dooɠo foloi Maliɠii.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu zeezaama zunui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matiyo 12:9-14</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luke 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Yesu lɛɛni ʋolu GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu. Zunui ta ɠɛni ná, nii zeei zaani ma. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Ti ɠɛni Yesu zumɔsu ga ni toɠa naa ɠɛdɛ dooɠo foloi. Ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti peelalazu zɔlɔɔ ba.<verse eid="MRK 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>Yesu ɠɛni zunui ma, nii zeei zaani ma: «Wuzeɠe, è lo ɛsɛ pɛ gaazu.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Tɔgi vaaʋɛ nɛi bu ga dooɠo foloi, nu faa ʋagɔi ɠɛ, ɓaa nu faa ɲɔi ɠɛ? Nu è nui yɛnvui ɠizo, ɓaa è nu ʋaa?» Kɛlɛ ti pɛ ti maaɠɛni kpɔ.<verse eid="MRK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Yesu ziiɠaawana wɛlɛi woni ti ʋa, zii ɓɔlɔai koozu ga gola tɔɔzei ta-ɠikpaai ʋa. Naa ʋolu é ɠɛni zunui ma: «Yeemaale.» Naa yeei maaleni, é ɠɛdɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Faliziɛinti ti ɠulani, ti li. Ti ɠi feeni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ gaamago ta Elɔde ʋolu nuiti ga ʋelei ta zoo ti Yesu ʋaa la.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ta bɛbɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Yesu liini ga Galilé ɗɛ wolai ʋɔ pelei ta ná-kaladopoiti. Bɛbɛ wolai ʋilɛni polu, ti zeɠe Galilé yooi zu, ta Zudé yooi zu, <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>ta Zeluzalɛme, naa ʋɛɛ Idumé ta Zuludɛn ziɛ ʋoluʋele yooi ʋa, ta Tiil ta Sidɔn yooiti su. Bɛbɛi naati ti ɠɛni ʋaazu pɔ, tɔɔzei ti naama vaiti pɛ mɛnini, niiti é ɠɛni ti ɠɛɛzu. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>É zɛba é ɠɛ ná-kaladopoiti ma, ti keingi gila kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ bɛ, é lɛ su, nii a kɛ bɛbɛi mina ziɠaziɠa ba. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tɛi é ɠɛni nu mɔinmɔin kɛdɛsu, seeɓɛ nuiti pɛ ti ɗa zɔɔ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, nii a kɛ ti yeevɔɔɠu ba. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Siɛgi zu kɔzɔba yɛnvuiti ta la ɠaazulaana la ma, ti ɠɛni loozu kɔɠɔwu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa è ga GALA Doun Zunui.» <verse eid="MRK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ɠɛni ti wola laa maaɓakpasu ga ti mina dɛɛ, nui ma zii nii é le.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yiimazeɠe vai ga <optbreak/> keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matiyo 10:1-4</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luke 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Naa ʋoluma é lɛɛni gizei ta ma. É nuiti tolini, niiti é ɠɛni ti ʋɔ, naati ti ʋa pɔ bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>É yiimazeɠeni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12), é naati kɛ ga keelaiti, nii a kɛ ti yɛ ba, é ti leʋe ga ti li, ti Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>ta zobogi ɠɛ ti ya ga ti inɛgiti kpɛ nuiti su.<verse eid="MRK 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>É yiimazeɠeni ga keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12), niiti ti ga: Simon, nii é daasei pɛɛni ga Piyɛlɛ, <verse eid="MRK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>Zeɓedé ná-doun zunuiti Zake, ta kɛɛɠɛloin Zan, niiti é ti-laasei pɛɛni ga Ɓoanɛɛlezɛse (nii poluʋɛ ga «geeɓadɛ loun zunuiti»), <verse eid="MRK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Andelé, Filipe, Ɓaatelemi, Matiyo, Tomase, Alefé ná-doun zunui Zake, Tadé, Simon nii é ɠɛni ga Zou Maalobo Nui ta, <verse eid="MRK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>naa ʋɛɛ Zudase Isekaliyɔte ʋa, nii é Yesu yaavani.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ɓaa Setana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matiyo 12:22-32</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luke 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Naa ʋoluma é ɠaleni ma pɛlɛi wu. Bɛbɛ wolai ɠaalɛɛni ba ʋolu koba. Naati mɔin ʋelei ma, Yesu ta ná-kaladopoiti ti la vɔlɔ ɠɛni ná zɔlɔɔsu, ti ʋa daami wo. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti ti naa mɛnigai ma, ti ʋaani ga ti kula bɛbɛi zaama, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Kigi ɠula zea.»<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Tɔ kalamɔin niiti ti yeini, ti zeɠe Zeluzalɛme, naati ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Inɛ kundiɠii Ɓeelezeɓule ɠa su, naa ná-zobogi ɠa é inɛgiti kpɛɛzu la.» <verse eid="MRK 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Yesu zɛba é ti loli, é faiti zɔɠɔzulɛ ga tiye ga pagɔ ga faalaaliiti, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Setana ɠa zoo ɓɔɠɔ ɓɛɛzu ɠale? <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/>Ni masadai ta zu nuɓusɛiti ta ɠaaɠwɛɛna su ɓɔɠɔ laalɔɠɔma, naa la zooga yɛsu ná. <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/>Ni pɛlɛyeɠei ta a ɠaaɠwɛɛna su ɓɔɠɔ laalɔɠɔma, naa la zooga yɛsu ná. <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/>Ni Setanai ɠa kɔɔi ɠɔɔzu ɓɔɠɔ laalɔɠɔma, ni ná-masadai ɠaaɠwɛɛʋɛ su, é la zooga yɛsu ná, nɔnɔi ɓega ɠana. <verse eid="MRK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/>Nu la ɗa ga zoo è ʋa lɛ zɛbɛsu nui ná-pɛlɛi wu, è ʋa naa ɠɔligiti seɠe, ni è la tɔɔzeini dɛ ga è ʋa naa ɠili ga galui. Ɗa naa ɠili pɛ, è ʋa leɠa ná-pɛlɛi wuuvoo. <verse eid="MRK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠotoiti pɛ, ta woo ɲɔiti pɛ ta ti wo GALA daalɔɠɔma, naati suvaa ɠa yɛ ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/>Kɛlɛ nu nɔpɛ é woo ɲɔu wosu Zɛnvu Ɲadegai laalɔɠɔma, suvaa la yɛga naama nui ʋɛ pɛ, naama ɠotoi ɠa yɛ laani unma eyɛsu ɠɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>Yesu ɓɔɛni ti ʋɔ ɠani, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni ma: «Kɔzɔba yɛnvui ɠa su.»<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-pɛlɛyeɠe ɠitei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matiyo 12:46-50</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luke 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Yesu dee ta deɠeiti ti ʋaani. Ti loni eteaʋɛ, ti keela leʋe polu ga ti toli. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Nu mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni zeini koba, ti ɠɛ ma: «È-lee ta è-leɠeiti ta eteaʋɛ, ta pɔ ti è ɠa.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa é ga dèe? Ɓɛɛni ka ti ga dèɠeiti?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>É ɠaazulɛɛni ga zɔiti, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini, ti ɠakugai ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Wɛlɛ, niiti ka ti ga dèe ta dèɠeiti. <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ é GALA ziimai ɠɛɛzu, naama nui ɠa é ga dèɠe zunui, ta dèɠe anzanui, ta dèe.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> molo zuwu vaza nui ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matiyo 13:1-9</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luke 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Yesu tɔɔzeini mɔnɔ ga é ɗa nuiti kala ziɛ wolai laaʋɛ. Bɛbɛ wolai ɠaalɛɛni ba koba. Kɛni é lɛɛni keingi ta zu vɔlɔ, é zei ná. Keingi ɠɛni ziɛ wolai ɠa, bɛbɛi pɛ ge ɠɛni loni kakei ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>É ɠɛni ti ɠalasu ga faa mɔinmɔin faalaaliiti su. Pɛtɛ ʋele ɠa é ɓɔɛni la ti ʋɔ: <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/>«À woilo dɛɛ: Molo zuwu vaza nui ta ɠulani ga é molo zuwui vaza. <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/>Kɛai ma moloi vazasu, molo ɠaei tanigaa ti looni pele ɠɛzɛi zu, wɔniiti ti ʋa, ti mi. <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/>Taɠiligaa ti looni fasa lutui zu, pɔlɔi tago nɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ná. Ti ʋɔnɔni fala, tɔɔzei zooi ɓoma la ɠɛni ɠoozani. <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/>Kɛlɛ foloi kpaai ma kpekpe, é molo ʋɔnɔ koiti galani ma fala. Ti vɔɔni, tɔɔzei sape la ɠɛni ti ʋa sɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/>Taɠiligaa ti looni ɠaingiti saama. Naati ti lɛɛni, ti molo ʋɔnɔ koiti maaɓɔle. Ti la waani pɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/>Taɠiligaa ti looni mɔnɔ zou ʋagɔi zu. Ti ɓɛtɛni, ti waa, ma ɠɔpɔgiti ti wɔɔlɔ eyɛsu ti mɔin, tanigaa ti-ɠaawaai ɠɛ ga puuzaʋasaʋa (30), tanigaa puulɔzitalɔzita (60), tanigaa ungilagila (100).» <verse eid="MRK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma ʋolu: «Zɔi faa mɛni goiyeɠe ba, naama nui nii mɛni.»<verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ná-faalaaliiti bo ungi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matiyo 13:10-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luke 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Siɛgi zu ti lago maaɠelesa ge leʋeni la, zɔiti ti ɠɛni koba, naa ʋɛɛ keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) ba, ti gaazaɠani faalaaliiti ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «GALA ná-masadai ma lɔɔɠuzu vaiti feeʋɛ wo ʋɛ, kɛlɛ zɔiti ti ga kamaʋolu nuiti, ta lɛɛzu ga naati, faalaaliiti su, <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/>naa ɠa a kɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">‹Ti ɗa wɛlɛ nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">kɛlɛ ti mina wozaɠa pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">ti ɗa woilo nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">kɛlɛ ti mina faa ɠaaɠa pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">nii a kɛ ti mina ɠale ma GALA pɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">ti ʋa ta-ɠotoiti ma zuvaayɛgi zɔlɔɔ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Eza 6:9-10</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note>»<verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii zuɠulazuʋɛ <optbreak/> pilɛgai molo zuwu vaza nui ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matiyo 13:18-23</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luke 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Wo la niima vaalaalii ɠaaɠaani? Wa zoo ɠale wo zɔiti gaaɠa? <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/>Molo zuwu vaza nui ɠa é ga naama nui, nii é GALA daawooi vazasu. <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/>Niiti ti molo zuwui zɔlɔɔgai pele ɠɛzɛi zu, ti la vɔlɔ ɓeni ga wooi zɔlɔɔ, Setana ʋa, é naa ɠula ti-yiimaʋɛ, nii fazagai ná. <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/>Zɔiti ti molo zuwui zɔlɔɔgai fasa lutui zu, naati ka ti wooi mɛnisu nɔ feya, ti yeezei bu ga koozunɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/>Kɛlɛ ti la naa yɛsu ná, é ʋa zapelɔ ti-yiimaʋɛ, ti la ɗa ga so kpaan. Siɛgi zu kpɔlɔi ɓaa wɔinzeɠemai ʋaazu la wooi maaʋele ma, gaamanɔ ta ɠalesu ma. <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/>Zɔiti ti molo zuwui zɔlɔɔgai ɠaingiti saama, naati ka ti wooi mɛnisu, <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/>kɛlɛ naa maa ɠa ɓɔɔlezu ga eteai ma yiizoolɛi, naavolo wɔin, ta ani wɔinlai ma zii pɛ, niiti ti lɔɔzu ti-yiimaʋɛ, é la ɗa ga waa. <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/>Zɔiti ti molo zuwui zɔlɔɔgai zou ʋagɔi zu, naati ka ti wooi mɛnisu, ti yeezei bu. Toɠa waazu, ma ɠae ɠilagilagi tanigaa ti-ɠaawaai ɠɛ ga puuzaʋasaʋa (30), tanigaa puulɔzitalɔzita (60), tanigaa ungilagila (100).»<verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> lanboi ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luke 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Anɠɛ nɛi nu ɠa ɗa ʋa ga lanboi, è dɔ aniɲakai wu, ɓaa betei wu? Kɛbɛ lanbo zei anii ɠa nu a ɗa sei ga, kɛlɛ? <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/>Tɔɔzei maalɔɔɠu vaa nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii é la ɠulaa kɛlɛma. Dɔɔɠuzu vaa nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii é la laa wozakalagi ɠa. <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/>Zɔi faa mɛni goiyeɠe ba, naama nui nii mɛni.»<verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «À dama ga fai nii wo mɛnisu. Kɔɠɔ ganii nii nɔ wo kɔɠɔgi wosu su, GALA ka kɔɠɔgi wo ɓalaa naa zu wo ʋɛ, é ta ɓɔ ba. <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi ani zea, ta ɠa ve naa ya ʋolu. Kɛlɛ zɔi ani la zea, anɛɛ zɔɔgoi é zea, naa ɠa ɠula zea.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> ani zuwui ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>É ɠɛni ti ma mɔnɔ: «GALA ná-masadai ɠulaʋɛ eɠɛ zunui nii é ani zuwui vazani ná-kpalagi zu. <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni ɲiizu ga kpidii, ɓaa é ɗa wuzeɠe folo-o-folo, ani zuwui ɠɛni ʋɔnɔsu nɔ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, é ɗa ɓaɠo, tɔun é la kwɛɛni ʋele naa ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la. <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/>Zooi ɓɔɠɔ molo lufai ʋɔnɔni, é tɔɔzei dɛ ga ma lɔkulugi, naa ʋoluma molo ɠɔpɔgi, é gaaɓela ga molo ɠae ga pagɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/>Kɛlɛ tɛi moloi mɔɔni nɔ feya, zunui nii boɠa goi lɔɔni su gaamanɔ, tɔɔzei molo leʋe yeeɠɛɠalai zeelia.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> mutaalede kaei ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matiyo 13:31-32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luke 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>É ɠɛni ti ma mɔnɔ: «Ɓɛgele ɠa ada geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ʋokɔɠɔ ma? Faalaalii ɓɛgele ɠa ada bo, nii a kɛʋele lɛ? <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/>Geeɠɔlɔgi ma masadai ɠulaʋɛ ga mutaalede kae ɠilagi. Siɛgi zu nu siinsu la zooi ma, tɔ ɠa dɔiɗai ani zuwui kpein saama eteai zu. <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/>Kɛlɛ siinga ʋoluma, toɠa ɗa wɔɔlɔ, gaaɠooza kpelei zu ziinziin ganigiti pɛ ba, ma ɓekegiti ti lo ba, wɔniiti ti ɗa laɠagi lo ma niinigi wu.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Yesu ɠɛni nuiti kalasu ga GALA daawooi, faalaali mɔinmɔin su, é soloo naa ma, nii ti gaaɠaazu. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>É la ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu ti ʋɔ, ni faalaali la ba. Ti maaɠelesa ga leʋena ta ná-kaladopoiti, é ɓena ti pɛ poluʋɛ lɛ ga naati.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu fiilɛ wolai ɠaayei vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matiyo 8:23-27</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luke 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>Naama voloi, kpɔkɔi zeeliai ma, Yesu ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti ma: «Ade leʋe ziɛ ʋoluʋelei.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Ti bɛbɛi yɛni ná, ti li ga Yesu keingi zu, nii é ɠɛni zeini su. Keingi taɠiligaa ti ʋilɛni polu. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Fiilɛ wolai zɛba é lokoleʋe, ziɛi ɗa ɲiikpi takpatakpa, é ɗa vala keingi zu, é ɗa daave. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Tɔun nɔnɔi, é ɠɛni laani keingi ɓogaʋɛ, é ɗa ɲi, nɔungi laani undama ɓɔlɔi ma. Kaladopoiti ti maaloɠani, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, gi undaa ɠana ʋili, ɗɔun, naa la è yiizoolɛzu?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>É wuunni, é devei ve fiilɛi ya ga sɛbɛi, é ɠɛ ziɛi ma: «Bu ɠɛ toun! Maaɠɛ kpɔ!» Fiilɛi zuleʋeni kpe, woza ɠaalɛi tɔɔntɔɔn. <verse eid="MRK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>É ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo luazu? Kidaaleʋe la wo ya?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Naati ti wola luani, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga: «Ɓɛ ɠa é ga nii mu, nii fiilɛi ta ziɛi ti ɠolozu gooi ʋɛ?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu inɛ su nui ʋalo vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matiyo 8:28-34</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luke 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Ti zeelini ziɛ wolai ʋoluʋelei, Gelase nuiti ta-yooi zu. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Yesu ɠulani nɔ feya keingi zu, inɛ su zunu ɠila ge ɠulani ga kabama ʋelei, é daaɠomi. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Zunui naa ɲiizuʋɛ ɠɛni ga kabamaʋɛ. Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni zoosu ɓalaa, é ʋa gili ga yɔlɔɠɔi, é ʋa yɛ su. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Tɔɔzei siɛ mɔinmɔin su, ti ɓena gili ga yɔlɔɠɔi, ti kɔluiti pili kɔɠɔiti ba, kɛlɛ é ɓena yɔlɔɠɔiti teʋeleʋe ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, é kɔluiti suɠaleɠale. Zobo ge la ɠɛni nu nɔpɛ bɛ, é ʋa vɔni ma. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Folo ʋɛɛ kpidi ʋa, zunui nii ɓena ɠɛ nɔ kabamaʋɛ ta gizei ma, é ɗa kpeei loo, é ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maawana ga kɔtuiti.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>É Yesu ɠaai ma ɠoozama, é ɓizɛni, é loo kɔɠɔwu. <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>É ɓainni ga woo wola, é ɠɛ ma: «GALA nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda, naa ná-Doun Zunui Yesu, lee ɠa è pɔ è sei mà? Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu GALA daaseigi zu, mina kpɔ̀lɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Tɔɔzei Yesu devei veeni zea, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ʋe, kɔzɔba yɛnvui, ɠula zunui nii zu!»<verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Yesu gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «È-laasei ka ga lee?» É naa wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Dàa ɠa ga ‹Ma Ɓulugi›, tɔɔzei gi mɔinʋɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>É Yesu wola maanɛɛnɛni, ga naa mina ti ɠula zooi ʋa.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Boi kpulu gola ɠɛni laamiizu náʋɛ, gizei ma. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Inɛgiti ti Yesu maanɛɛnɛni ga gola, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi leʋe kae boigi nuuti su, è va bu, gi lɔ ti zu!» <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Yesu vaani naa wu kɔzɔba yɛnvuiti bɛ. Ti zɛba ti ɠula zunui zu, ti lɔ boigiti su. Boi kpulugi, nii a la zeeli boi waafelegɔ (2.000) zu, naati pɛ ti yeini ga kpizɛ gize ɠakazuʋɛ, ti ʋu ziɛi wu, ti yɛ bu nɔ mɛtu.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Boi makɛ nuiti ti ʋelani, ti ma wooi laazeeli taa wolai zu, ta ɓalaɠaiti su. Nuiti ti ɠɛni liizu, ti ɗa naa ɠa, nii kɛai. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Ti ʋaani Yesu ɠobaʋɛ, ti zunui ɠa, nii inɛ kpulugi ɠɛni su mɔungi. É ɠɛni zeini ná, seɠei kɔba, kigi ma ga pagɔ. Nuiti ti wola luani. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Zɔiti fai ɠɛɛni ti ɠaazu, naati ti naama vai zuɠulani ti ma, nii é ɠɛɛni ga inɛ su zunui naa ta boigiti. <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Nui naati ti tɔɔzeini ga ti ɗa Yesu maanɛɛnɛ ga é ɠula ta-yooi ʋa.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Yesu ɠɛai ma lɛɛzu ʋolu keingi zu, zunui nii inɛgiti ti ɠulani su, naa Yesu maanɛɛnɛni ga tɔun é ʋilɛ Yesu ʋolu. <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Yesu la ɠɛni vaani naa wu, kɛlɛ é ɠɛni ma: «Li taazu, è naa wo ɗa-nuiti ma, nii Maliɠii kɛai è ʋɛ, ʋelei é è maawɔinɠaai la.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Zunui naa zɛba é li, é naa pɛ daazeeli Taa Wola Puugɔiti su, nii Yesu kɛɛni bɛ. Zɔiti ti ɠɛni gooi mɛnisu, naati daavɔɔni ga gola.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zayiluse ná-doun anzanui <optbreak/> ta ɲama ɠula koozu anzanui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matiyo 9:18-26</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luke 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Yesu lɛɛni keingi zu, é zɔɔma ɗɛ ʋoluʋɛ maazɔlɔɔ. Bɛbɛ wolai maaɓɔni koba miná, ziɛlaʋɛ kakei ma. <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi ma ɠundiɠii gila ge ʋaani, nii daa ɠɛni ga Zayiluse. É Yesu ɠaai ma, é looni kɔɠɔwu, <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>é maanɛɛnɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Dòun anzanui ɠana za. Ʋa, è yeela ma, nii a kɛ é ʋalo, é zɛnvui wo.» <verse eid="MRK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Yesu zɛba é ʋilɛ polu, ti ɗa li. Bɛbɛi kɛ kpu, é ʋilɛ ti ʋolu, ti ɗa ziɠaziɠa Yesu ʋa.<verse eid="MRK 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Anzanui ta ɠɛni ná, nii é kɛɛni ɲama ɠula koozu zeeɓɛi zu ga kona puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>É wola ɓɔlɔni niina ɗɔɠɔtɔlɔ mɔinmɔin zeezu, é ná-naavoloi pɛ kwɛɛ, tanɔpɛ ge la zeɠeni ná-seeɓɛi ʋa, kɛlɛ ta nɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ʋilisu su. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>É Yesu maawoo mɛnini. É lɔɔni bɛbɛi zaama, é maaɓuɠa Yesu ʋa ga poluʋelei, é yeevɔɔɠu naa ná-seɠei ʋa. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Tɔɔzei é ɠɛni ma: «Ni nà zoona nɔ gè yeevɔɔɠu ná-seɠei ʋa, nà ʋalo.» <verse eid="MRK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Gaamago, ná-ɲama ɠula koozui maaleʋeni. É gaaɠaani ɠɔlɔ su ga é ɠɛdɛga.<verse eid="MRK 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Gaamago nɔ, Yesu gaaɠaani ga zɛbɛi ta ɠulaʋɛ su. É latini bɛbɛi ma, é gaazaɠagi wo, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa fɔɔɠuai nà-seɠei ʋa?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Ná-kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa ɓɔɠɔi ɗa bɛbɛi ɠaazu, é ziɠaziɠazu è ʋa, ɗɔun è zɛba è ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɓɛ ɠa fɔɔɠuai bà?› »<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Kɛlɛ tɔun é ɠɛni ɠaazuziɛzu bɛbɛi zaama, nii a kɛ é naama nui ʋɛtɛ, nii é yeevɔɔɠuai ba. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Dualuagi zɛba é anzanui zo, é ɗa ɓali, é kwɛɛni nii kɛai la. É ʋaani, é loo Yesu ɠɔɠɔwu, é gaamai pɛ bo naa ma. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Dòun anzanu, tɛi è laa dà, è ʋaloa. Li ziilɛigi zu, è ɠula ɗa-zoolɛi zu.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Yesu yɛni nɔ ɓɔɛzu, nui tanigaa ti ʋa, ti zeɠe GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi ma ɠundiɠii ná-koizuʋɛ, ti ɠɛ ma: «È-loun anzanui zaa. Lee vaa zu ɗa li kalamɔin ɓɔlɔzu mɔnɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu naama wooiti mɛnigai ma, é ɠɛni GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi ma ɠundiɠii ma: «Mina lua. Ɠidaaleʋe nɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 5:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>É la ɠɛni vaani bu ga nu ɠili ge ʋilɛ polu, kɛni Piyɛlɛ, Zake ta naa kɛɛɠɛloin Zan. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Ti zeelizuʋɛ GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi ma ɠundiɠii ná-pɛlɛi wu, Yesu kaani ga zɔngɔ wolai ɠa ná, nuiti ti ɗa wɔlɔ, ti ɗa kpee wolaiti too. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Yesu lɛɛni pɛlɛi wu, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Lee ma zɔngɔ wola ɠa é ʋɛ? Lee wɔlɔ ɠa é wosu? Doungoi la zaani, toɠa ɲiizu nɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Kɛlɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni ɲɛɛɠulazu su. É nuiti kulaai ma eteaʋɛ, ti lɛɛni pɛlɛi wu, ʋɛ anzanu loungoi ɠɛni laani ná, ta doungoi kɛɛɠɛ ta dee, naa ʋɛɛ ná-kaladopoiti ba, niiti ti ɠɛni polu. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>É doungoi zoni zeei ʋa, é ɠɛ ma: «Talita kumi» (nii poluʋɛ ga «anzalopoi, nà è levezu, wuzeɠe»). <verse eid="MRK 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Gaamago nɔ, anzalopoi wuzeɠeni, é ɗa ziɛ. Ná-konagi ɠɛni ga puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). Ti wola laavɔɔni gaamanɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Yesu ti laa maaɓakpani ga nu nɔpɛ ge mina naama vai ɠwɛɛ. É ɠɛni ti ma ti daamii ve anzalopoi ya.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Nazalɛte nuiti ti ɠɛlɛ vai Yesu ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matiyo 13:53-58</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luke 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Yesu zeɠeni miná, é li taai naa zu, ʋɛ é kulasui woni ná, ná-kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni polu. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Dooɠo foloi, é tɔɔzeini ga kalagi woga GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛi wu. Niiti ti ɠɛni woilosu gooi ma, naa ma mɔinmɔin daavɔɔni, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga: «Mini ɠa é niima vaiti pɛ sɔlɔɔgai ná? Mini ɠa é niima ɠimalai zɔlɔɔgai ná, ta zobogi nii é laavɔɔ vai niiti kɛɛzu la? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Gulu zaɠa nui la ga nii, Mali ná-doun zunui, Zake, Zoze, Zude, ta Simon ti-liɛi? Baazeelaiti tɛi ti ʋa ɠɛ ade zaama?» Naa ɠa é ɠɛɛni ga zaɓui ti la ɠɛni laani da.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «GALA goo wo nui ɓɔɠɔ yooi, ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nɔ ɠa, sɔlɔɔ nuiti saama, é la ɗa ga unfema zɔlɔɔ ná.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>É la ɠɛni zooni é ʋa laavɔɔ vaa ɠɛ ná, é ɠula seeɓɛ nu ɠilagilagiti polu, niiti é yeelaani ti ma, é ti ɠɛdɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Gola laavɔɔni ga naati ta-ɠidaaleʋelalai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) teʋe fai</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matiyo 10:5-15</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luke 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu ɠɛni leʋeteʋesu ná maaɠoolii zu laaiti su, é ɗa kalagi wo. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>É keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) tolini, é ti leʋe keela ziɛgi ma ga nu velefele, é zobogi ve ti ya kɔzɔba yɛnvuiti unda. <verse eid="MRK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>É ti leveni ga: «À mina ani nɔpɛ seɠe siɛi wo fai zu, kɛni tukpɔi ɠila nɔ. À mina ɠɔnɔ seɠe, ɓaa ɓɔlɔ, wo mina ɓalaa wali zeɠe yea. <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/>À saʋalagiti dɔ ɠɔɠɔa, wo mina seɠewuzeɠe felegɔ zeɠe. <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/>Pɛlɛ nɔpɛ wo lɛɛzu bu, à yɛ ná, eyɛsu wo zeɠena yeeɠɛɠalai zeeli. <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/>Ni tama, wa lɛɛna adɛ ta, ʋɛ ti la pɔ ga ti ʋa yeezei wo wu, ɓaa ti ʋa woilo wo-woo ma, à ɠula naa ʋa, wo fufiligi ɓukpunɛ, é ɠula wo-ɠɔɠɔiti ma, é ɠɛ ga zeele wooi ti laalɔɠɔma.»<verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Naati ma ti liini, ti Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli, ga kɛni nu ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Ti ɠɛni inɛ mɔinmɔin kpɛɛzu, ti ɗa gulɔi ziɛ seeɓɛ nui mɔinmɔin ma, ti ɗa naati kɛdɛ.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zan Ɓatisete zaa vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matiyo 14:1-12</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luke 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Masagi Elɔde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Elɔde</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Elɔde Antipase ʋe, nii é ɠɛni ga Galilé you zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii.</char></note> Yesu maawooi mɛnini, tɔɔzei naa lɔɠɔi ɠulani adaʋɛ pɛ. Nui tanigaa ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Zan Ɓatisete ɠa buzeɠeai, é ɠula saai ya. Naa ɠa é kɛɛzu, é laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛzu la.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Taɠiligaa ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Eli ʋe.» Zɔiti ti ɠɛ ma: «GALA goo wo nui ta ʋe, eɠɛ GALA goo wo nu wɔlɔwɔlɔgi ta.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Elɔde letemazu, siɛgi zu é naama wooiti mɛnini da, é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Zan nii gè devei veeni ga unteʋe, naa ɠa buzeɠeai, é ɠula saai ya!»<verse eid="MRK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Tɔɔzei kaite Elɔde devei veeni ga ti Zan zo, ti gili, ti pili kasoi ɠa, naa lɔɔzei kɛɛɠɛloin Filipe anzai Elɔdiade zei vai ʋa bɛ ga anza. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Zan ɓena ɠɛ Elɔde ma: «Tɔgi la vaani bu ga è ʋa è-ɠɛɛloin anzai zeɠe ga è-anza.»<verse eid="MRK 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Elɔdiade wanagi lɔɔni Zan laalɔɠɔma, é ɠɛni keleɠele gaiziɛzu ga é naa ʋaa, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni ma zobo sɔlɔɔsu. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Tɔɔzei Elɔde ɠɛni luazu Zan ʋa. É ɠɛni kwɛɛni ga naa ɠa ga telebo nu, ɲadegai. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni é ɠɛni ɓaazu naa maazu. A la ɠɛna naa woomɛniga, é ɓena ɠɛ kidaaʋiligi zu. Tama wɔin ɠɛni ma ga é ɗa naa woomɛni.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Kɛlɛ é ɠɛni ga yeeta, Elɔdiade yeeɠɛɠala zɔlɔɔni, Elɔde zɔlɔɔ foloi ma ɠona pilɛda yeei. Elɔde fɛti wolai ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni naama voloi, ná-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti bɛ, ta ná-salaʋusu ɠundiɠiiti, naa ʋɛɛ Galilé nu wolaiti pɛ ba. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Ti ɠɛai ma fɛtii ɠulazu, Elɔdiade ná-doun anzanui kuai woni. Elɔde ta niiti ti lolini fɛtii ɠulazuʋɛ, ti wola ɠoozunɛɛni. Masagi zɛba é ɠɛ anzalopoi ma: «Nii nɔpɛ è pɔ ga gè fe è ʋɛ, bo mà, nà fe è ya.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>É ɠonani vɔlɔ naa ʋɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Nii nɔpɛ ɗa fali mà, nà fe è ya, anɛɛ ɓalaa toɠa ɠɛɛzu ga nà-masadai ɠilazuʋɛ pɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Anzalopoi ɠulani, é dee ɠaazaɠa, é ɠɛ ma: «Lee ɠa nà fali?» Naa ɠɛ ma: «Zan Ɓatisete nɔungi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Gaamago nɔ, anzalopoi lɛɛni ga gaazuvilɛi, é ziima vai wo, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà pɔ Zan Ɓatisete nɔungi zeeli mà ʋɛ ɠaniɠani koi nɔ, aniɲaka lazakalagi zu.»<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Naa masagi wola yiiɓɔlɔni. Kɛlɛ ná-konai maaʋele ma é boni, ta nui niiti é ti lolini fɛti ɠula vai ma, é la ɠɛni pɔ ga é ʋa ɠɛlɛ ná-minazeɠegi laazeelizu naa ʋɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Gaamago nɔ, é salaʋusui ta leveni ga é ʋaa ga Zan nɔungi. Naa liini, é Zan nɔungi leʋe ba kasoi ɠa. <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>É ʋaani ga Zan nɔungi aniɲakai zu, é fe anzalopoi ya, é lii la, é fe dee ya. <verse eid="MRK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Zan ná-kaladopoiti ti naa mɛnigai ma, nii kɛai, ti ʋaani, ti ma ʋoomai zeɠe, ti maaɠulu kabayeɠei ta zu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zunu waadɔɔlugɔi (5.000) ɠɔnɔkula vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matiyo 14:13-21</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luke 9:10-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Zan 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Keelaiti paai ma, ti zeɠe siɛi ma, ti ɠaalɛɛni ba Yesu ɠobaʋɛ, ti ʋoluvaawo ma ga nii pɛ ti kɛai, ta kalagi nii pɛ ti feeni nuiti zea. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Yesu zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma: «À ʋilɛ pòlu, ade li adaʋɛ ta, ʋɛ ná maaɠelesa teʋeai, wo lago looɠo ná.» Tɔɔzei nu mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni lɛɛzu, ti ɗa yei, naa maaʋele ma ti la vɔlɔ ɠɛni yeeɠɛɠala zɔlɔɔsu, ti ʋa daami wo. <verse eid="MRK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Ti zɛba ti zeɠe ná, ti lɛ keingi zu, nii a kɛ ti li teʋebai ta zu.<verse eid="MRK 6:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Kɛlɛ nu mɔinmɔin ge ti ɠaani, ti ɠwɛɛsu ɠaani ti ʋa, ti liizuʋɛ. Nuiti ti ɠulani taaiti pɛ su, ti ɗa ɓizɛ ɠɔɠɔa, ti to da ti luɠɔ naama adaʋɛ, ʋɛ ti ɠɛni liizu ná. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Yesu ɠulaai ma keingi zu, é bɛbɛ wolai ɠaani. Naati maawɔin soni, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni eɠɛ baalagiti niiti makɛ nu la ti ʋɛ. É zɛba é tɔɔzei ga kalagi woga, é lɛbi ga.<verse eid="MRK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Foloi ɠɛnina liizu. Ná-kaladopoiti ti maaɓuɠani ba, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ʋɛ ɠa ga teʋebai zu, foloi lia. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Bɛbɛi ɠaaɠale ma, ti li ʋɛ ɠoba ɓalaɠaiti ta taa goiti su, ti ɠɔnɔ geya ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wa ɓɔɠɔi à ɠɔnɔ fe ti ya.» Ti ɠɛni ma: «Gi liina mu, gi wali ɠae unfelegɔ (200) ɓulu ɠeya, gi fe ti ya, ti mi?»<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «À li, wo ná ɠaa. Ɓulu lielegɔ ɠa é wo ya?» Ti liini, ti gaazaɠagi wo, ti ʋa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓulu lɔɔlugɔ ɠa é ná, naa ʋɛɛ kale felegɔ ʋa.»<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>É zɛba é devei ve ti ya ga ti nuiti sei kpifɔkpifɔ tufa lɛnugi zu. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Nuiti ti zeini kpifɔkpifɔ ga nu ungilagila (100), puulɔɔludɔɔlu (50). <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Yesu ɓulu lɔɔlugɔi ta kale felegɔiti seɠeni, é ɠaazulɛ geezu, é mama fee ƓALA falii wo. Naa ʋolu é ɓuluiti kpulukpuluni, é ma ɓuɠaiti fe kaladopoiti zea ga ti gaaɠwɛ bɛbɛi ʋa. É kale felegɔi ɓalaa gaaɠwɛɛni ɛsɛ pɛ ba. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ge daamii woni, ti yiɠo. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Kaladopoiti ti ɓulu ɓulukpulugi mɔtai ɠaalɛɛni ba ta kalei mɔtai, é ɠɛ ga kpɔlɔ puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Tama zɔiti ti ɓului naa miini, ti-liegɔi a la ɠɛ ga zunu waadɔɔlugɔ (5.000).<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ziɛ vai ziɛi ɠa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matiyo 14:22-33</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Zan 6:16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Naama vai ɓeni nɔ feya, Yesu ɓɔini ná-kaladopoiti da ga ti lɛ keingi zu, ti to da tuɠɔ, ti li ga ziɛ ʋoluʋelei, Ɓɛtesayida ʋele, naama ziɛ su, é ɗa bɛbɛi ɠaaɠale ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>É valiai ma ti ma, é lɛɛni gizei ma ga é GALA fali. <verse eid="MRK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Kpidii ʋɛai ma, keingi ɠɛni niina ziɛ zaamaʋɛ, Yesu ɠila kpe ka é yɛni kakei ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>É kaani ga ná-kaladopoiti ta wola ɓɔlɔzu ga keingi ɓizɛ vai, tɔɔzei fiilɛi ɠɛni ti laaɠomisu. Gosu yeeɠɛɠalai, é liini ga ti ʋɔ pelei, é ɗa ziɛ ziɛi ɠa. É ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu, é leʋe ti ʋa. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Ti kaai ma, é ɗa ziɛ ziɛi ɠa, é ɠɛni ti ɠisu ga gɔvɛ mɔtai ta ʋe. Ti ɠɛni kpeei loozu. <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Tɔɔzei ɛsɛ pɛ ge kaani, dualuagi lɔ ti pɛ su. Kɛlɛ gaamago Yesu ɓɔɛni ti ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À zɛbɛzeɠe, nà ʋe de. À mina lua!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>É zɛba é lɛ ti ɠoba keingi zu. Fiilɛi zuleʋe kpe. Ti wola laavɔɔni. <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti la ɠɛni ɓului ma laavɔɔ vai ɠaaɠaani, tɔɔzei ta-ɠikpaai ʋa.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu seeɓɛ nuiti balo vai Zenezalɛte ɠoʋii ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matiyo 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Ti ziɛi ɓudɛai ma, ti zeelini Zenezalɛte yooi ma, ti ta-ɠeingi laalɔni kakei ma. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Ti ɠulani nɔ feya keingi zu, gaamago bɛbɛi ɠwɛɛsu ɠaani Yesu ʋa. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Ti leʋeteʋeni naama yooi zu ná pɛ. Ti tɔɔzeini ga ti ʋa pɔ ga seeɓɛ nuiti kpaɠalaɓaɠalaiti ma, ʋɛ nɔpɛ ta la mɛnina ga toɠa ná. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Ʋɛ nɔpɛ a la li ná, taa goiti, taa wolaiti, ta ɓalaɠaiti su, ti ɠɛni ʋaazu pɔ ga seeɓɛ nuiti dɔɔɠɔ ɓalagiti su. Ti maanɛɛnɛni ga ti vɔɔɠu nɔ ná-seɠei laamaʋɛ ʋa. Tama zɔiti pɛ ti ɠɛni vɔɔɠuzu ba, ti ɠɛni ʋalozu.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ta kalagi <optbreak/> nii Zuifuiti ti-mɛmɛwolaiti ti zɛgai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matiyo 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Faliziɛinti ta tɔ kalamɔin tanigaa ti ʋaani, ti zeɠe Zeluzalɛme, ti ɠaalɛ ba Yesu maaɠoolii zu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Ti pɛtɛni ga ná-kaladopoi tanigaa ta ta-laamianigiti miizu ga kɔzɔba yeeiti, naa ʋolu ɠa ga ti la yeagbazu eɠɛʋelei Zuifuiti ta-ɠalagi ɠɛni la.<verse eid="MRK 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>(Tɔɔzei Faliziɛinti ta Zuifuiti kpein ti la ɗa ga daamii lɔɔzei, ni ti la yeagbani ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛ, ta naa ɠɛɛzu ga ti ɠolo kalagi naa ʋɛ, nii ti-mɛmɛwolaiti ti zɛgai ti ya. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Naa ʋoluma ta zeɠena dɔɔɠɔi zu, ti la daami woga, ni ti la ɲade fai ɠɛɛni. Faa wɔlɔma mɔinmɔin kiligaa ta ti ya ɓalaa, eɠɛʋelei gɔwɔiti, ziɛ liɠiiti ta kɔlu ɓɔi aniɲakaiti gba vai la.)<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Faliziɛinti ta tɔ kalamɔinti ti zɛba ti Yesu ɠaazaɠa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu ɗa-ɠaladopoiti ti la ziɛzu ga kɛwolaiti kɛɛ vaa wɔlɔmaiti? Lee vaa zu ti daamii wosu ga kɔzɔba yeeiti?» <verse eid="MRK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wɔi wo ga woovele nuiti! Wa ɠa GALA goo wo nui Ezayi ɠɛni vaazu wo ma GALA Sɛʋɛi zu, ʋɛ é sɛʋɛai ná ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‹Niima nuɓusɛiti ta dɛ̀bizu ga ti-lakɔlɔgiti nɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">kɛlɛ ti-yiimaʋɛ wola maaɠoozaʋɛ bà.<verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>Wafuun lɛbiya nɔ ɠa ti feezu bɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">tɔɔzei kalagi niiti ti bosu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">naa pɛ ka nɔ ga nuiti ta-leveiti.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:6-7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Eza 29:13</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>Wa GALA ná-deveiti zɛsu ná, wo ɗa ziɛ ga nuiti ta-vaa wɔlɔmaiti!»<verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Wo zoogɛ gola GALA ná-deveiti daazu ɠoba, nii a kɛ wo ɗa ziɛ ga wa-vaa wɔlɔmaiti! <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/>Tɔɔzei Moize bogɛ ga: ‹È-ɠɛɛ lɛbi ta è-lee,›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ɛgz 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">TSV 5:16</ref></char>.</char></note> é ɠɛ mɔnɔ: ‹Zɔi nɔpɛ é kɛɛɠɛ ɓaa dee ɠotozu, ta naama nui ʋaa.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 21:17">Ɛgz 21:17</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/>Kɛlɛ wɔun, wa ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Ni nui ta a ɠɛɛna kɛɛɠɛ ɓaa dee ma: Nii nà la kɛ ga ɗa-ɓɔbai, naa ɠɛa ga vebɛani GALA bɛ,› <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/>naazu, wo la mɔ ma nu yɛsu ná, é ʋa faa ɠɛ kɛɛɠɛ ɓaa dee ʋɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/>Ʋele ɠana wo GALA daawooi zeɠezu la ma, ga wa-vaa wɔlɔmaiti niiti wo ti veezu ɓɔɠɔ ya. Wa naa ɠɛɠala vai ma mɔinmɔin kɛɛzu.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ani niiti ti nui ɠɔzɔzu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matiyo 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Naa ʋoluma Yesu bɛbɛi lolini ʋolu, é ɠɛ ma: «Wo pɛ à woilo gòoi ma, wo gaaɠa ga pagɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/>Nii kpein é zeɠezu kamaʋoluʋɛ, é lɔ nui ɠoozu, naa lɛi a ɗa kɔzɔ. Kɛlɛ nii mu é ɠulazu nui yiimaʋɛ, naa ɠa a ɗa kɔzɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/>[Zɔi faa mɛni goiyeɠe ba, naama nui nii mɛni.]»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Siɛgi zu Yesu zeɠeni la bɛbɛi ʋolu, é lɛ pɛlɛi wu, ná-kaladopoiti ti gaazaɠani naama vaalaalii ʋoluʋɛ ma. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Koo, wɔun, wa ɓalaa wo la faa ɠaaɠaazu ɓaa? Wo la gaaɠaazu ga nii kpein é zeɠezu kamaʋoluʋɛ, é lɔ nui ɠoozu, naa tanɔpɛ ge la zooga nui ɠɔzɔzu. <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/>Tɔɔzei naa tanɔpɛ ge la lɔɔzu ziimaʋɛ, kɛlɛ toɠa liizu kogi zu, naa ʋoluma, é ʋili ya dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ.» (Kɛai ma naama wooiti bosu, é ɠɛni dɛɛzu ga daamianigiti pɛ ɲadegɛ.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>É zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma ʋolu: «Nii é ɠulazu nui zu, naa ɠa a ɗa kɔzɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/>Tɔɔzei nui ɠoozuʋɛ, ziimaʋɛ ɠa kisiɛ ɲɔiti ta ɗa zeɠe ná, niiti ti diizu koloɠologi ta unmai ma, naa ʋɛɛ nu ʋaa vai <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/>ta wɛɛnziɛgi ʋa, ta koozu yii, ta suɲɔulai, naa ʋɛɛ yaavai ta ɓaaɠulama vai ʋa, ta toloi, ta tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠologi, naa ʋɛɛ wasogi ta ɠimalala vai ʋa. <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/>Naama vaa ɲɔiti pɛ ta zeɠezu nui yiimaʋɛ, ti ɗa kɔzɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kidaaleʋei é ɠɛni anzanui ya, é la ga Zuifui ta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matiyo 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Yesu zeɠeni miná, é li Tiil yooi zu. É lɛɛni pɛlɛi ta wu, é la ɠɛni pɔ ga nu ʋa suɠwɛɛ ga toɠa ná, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni zooni é ʋa yɛ dɔɔɠui zu. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Tɔɔzei é ʋaani nɔ feya, anzanui ta maawoo mɛnini, nii kɔzɔba yɛnvui ɠɛni ná-doun anzanui zu. É ʋaani gaamago nɔ Yesu ʋɔ bɛ, é loo kɔɠɔwu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>É ɠɛni ga zii ɠili anzanu, sɔlɔɔgai Fenisi ɠoʋii ma, Siili yooi zu. É Yesu maanɛɛnɛni ga naa inɛgi ɓɛ, nii é ná-doun anzanui zu.<verse eid="MRK 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓe doungoiti ba dɛ, ti yiɠo, tɔɔzei maa la nɛɛni ga nu doungoiti kɔnɔgi ɠula ti ya, é pili gilɛ goiti bu.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Anzanui ɠɛni ma: «Gaama ʋe, Màliɠii, kɛlɛ gilɛ goi niiti ti daami wosuʋɛ ɠoba, ta ɗa daamiani kpulukpulu koiti mi, niiti ti ɠulazu doungoiti zeewu, ti loo zooi ma.»<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Naama wooi maaʋele ma, li ɗa-ɠoizu, inɛgi ɠulaa è-loun anzanui zu.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Anzanui ɠaleni ma ná-koizu. É pɛtɛni ga ná-doun anzanui ɠa laani betei zu, inɛgi ɠulaai niina su.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zunui ta ɠɛdɛ fai, <optbreak/> nii é ɠɛni ga ɓoɓoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Yesu zeɠeni Tiil yooi zu, é leʋe ga Sidɔn ʋele, é Taa Wola Puugɔi ma yooi maaleʋe, é zeeli Galilé ɗɛ wolai ma. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Ti ʋaani pɔ ga goizuɓɔlɔ nui, é ga ɓoɓoi, ti maanɛɛnɛni ga é yeela ma. <verse eid="MRK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Yesu kulani bɛbɛi zaama, é ti felegɔ maaɠelesa teʋe. Kpegai ma ga yeeɓeɠaiti dɔ naa woiyeɠeiti su, é laaɗɛi ʋuuni ya, é fɔɔɠu naa nɛgi ʋa. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠaazulɛɛni geezu, é yɛnvu fɛɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɛfata.» Naa ʋoluʋɛ ɠa ga: «Ɗa ʋe de, laalao!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Gaamago, zunui naa woiyeɠeiti daalaoni, nɛgi vie, é ɗa kpɔɛi zuɠula su ɠɛ kala.<verse eid="MRK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni ná ɠobaʋɛ, Yesu ti laa maaɓakpani ga ti mina faa nɔpɛ bo nu ma. Kɛlɛ tɔun a la ɠɛna pele leʋega ti luɠɔ ga ti mina bo, naati mu ti ɠɛni liizu nɔ ga daazeelia. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Bɛbɛi laavɔɔni ga gola, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nii pɛ é kɛɛzu, ti pɛ pagɛ ga gola! Toɠa goizuɓɔlɔ nuiti goiyeɠeiti daalaosu, é ɗa ɓoɓoiti daaʋɛti fie, ti ɗa ɓɔɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu nu waanaanigɔi (4.000) ɠɔnɔkula vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matiyo 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Naama voloiti su, bɛbɛ wola ɠaalɛɛni ba mɔnɔ Yesu ɠoba, daamiani ge la ɠɛni ti ya. Yesu zɛba é ná-kaladopoiti toli, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/>«Bɛbɛi nii maawɔin sòga, mazɔlɔɔ folo saʋagɔ ɠa ti kòba, daamiani nɔpɛ ge la ti ya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/>Nà pului yɛna ti ma, gè ti ɠaaɠale ma ta-ɠoizuʋɛti, zɛbɛi ɠa ɠula ti ya pelei zu, tɔɔzei tanigaa zeɠezu ɠoozaʋɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Ná-kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Mini ɠa nu a ɓulu zɔlɔɔ ná, é kula ɠɛ niiti pɛ ba, teʋebai nii zu?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>É ti ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ɓulu lielegɔ ɠa é wo ya?» Ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓulu lɔfela.»<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>É zɛba é bɛbɛi leve ga ti zei zooi ma. Naa ʋoluma, é ɓulu lɔfelaiti seɠeni. Kpegai ma ga mamagi ve GALA bɛ, é ti ɠaleɠaleni, é ti ve ná-kaladopoiti zea ga ti gaaɠwɛ bɛbɛi ʋa. Naati ti gaaɠwɛɛni bɛbɛi ʋa. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Kalei tago ɓalaa ge ɠɛni ná. Yesu mama fee ƓALA falii woni ɓalaa ma, é ɠɛ ná-kaladopoiti ma, ti gaaɠwɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Ti pɛ ti daamii woni, ti yiɠo. Kaladopoiti ti ma ɓulukpulugi mɔtai ɠaalɛɛni ba, é ɠɛ ga kpɔlɔ dɔfela. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Nu waanaanigɔ (4.000) ɠɛɠala ɠa é ɠɛni ná. Naa ʋoluma Yesu ti ɠaaɠaleni ma. <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Gaamago ti lɛɛni keingi zu ta ná-kaladopoiti, ti li Dalamanuta yooi zu.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Laavɔɔ vaa maaɠaazaɠabo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Matiyo 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Faliziɛinti ti ʋaani, ti maaɠaali laalɛ bu. Ti gaazaɠani ga é laavɔɔ vai ta ɠula kɛlɛma, é ɠulazu geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Ti ɠɛni pɔ ti suɠɔɠɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Yesu yɛnvu maaɠulani fɛɛ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Lee vaa zu niizuʋɛ nuɓusɛiti ti laavɔɔ vaa maaɠaazaɠabosu? Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, poo nɔpɛ ge la vea ti ya.» <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>É ti yɛni ná, é lɛ keingi zu ʋolu, é li ga ziɛ ʋoluʋelei.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faliziɛinti ta Saduseyɛinti ta-lɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matiyo 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Kaladopoiti ti yeemani, ti la ɓulua zeɠeni, gila kpe nɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ti ya keingi zu. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Yesu zɛba é devei ve ti ya, é ɠɛ ma: «À ɓɔɠɔ zo, wo dama ga Faliziɛinti ta-lɛʋɛi ta Elɔde nɔnɔi.»<verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Kaladopoiti ti zɛba ti ɗa ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Tɛi ade la ɓulu zeɠeni, naa ɠa é nuuma wooi wosu da.»<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Tɛi Yesu ti ɠisu vai ɠwɛɛni, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo kpɔɛi zuɠulazu ga tɛi wo la ɓulu zeɠeni? Wo la dɛ ɠidaazu faiti bu, wo ʋa ti ɠaaɠa ɓaa? Wo ɠikpaaʋɛ mu? <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/>Wo-ɠaazuʋɛti ti la wozaɠaazu? Wo-woiyeɠeiti ti la faa mɛnisu? Wo-ɠi ge la looni ná zu: <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/>Siɛgi zu gè ɓulu lɔɔlugɔi ɠaaɠwɛɛni la zunu waadɔɔlugɔi (5.000) ʋa, mɔtai é yɛni, wo gaalɛ ba, é ɠɛni ga kpɔlɔ dielegɔ?» Ti ɠɛ ma: «Puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12).»<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Naa ʋoluma gè ɓulu lɔfelai ɠaaɠwɛai ma zunu waanaanigɔi (4.000) ʋa, mɔtai é yɛni, wo gaalɛ ba, é ɠɛni ga kpɔlɔ dielegɔ?» Ti ɠɛ ma: «Dɔfela.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>É zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma mɔnɔ: «Wo la dɛ gaaɠaani?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaazuɠole nui ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Ti zeelini Ɓɛtesayida. Nuiti ti ʋaani ga gaazuɠole nui ta Yesu ʋɔ miná, ti maanɛɛnɛ ga é yeevɔɔɠu ba. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Yesu gaazuɠole nui zoni zeei ʋa, é ɠula la taai ʋa. Naa ʋoluma é laaɗɛi ziɛni naa ɠaazuʋɛ, é yeela ma, é gaazaɠa ga: «Ɗa zoosu è ani ɠa?»<verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Gaazuɠole nui gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà nuiti kaazu, eɠɛ guluiti ti ɗa ziɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Yesu yeevɔɔɠuni ʋolu gaazuɠɛzɛiti ba. Gaamago nɔ gaazuɠole nui ɠaazuʋɛ zeɠeni ma, é ɗa wozaɠa ga pagɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Yesu ɓeni ba é li ná-koizu, kɛlɛ é ɠɛni ma: «Mina vɔlɔ lɛ taazuʋɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛlɛ Yesu ɠwɛɛ fai ga Kilista</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matiyo 16:13-20</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luke 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Yesu ta ná-kaladopoiti ti liini taa goiti su, niiti ti Sezalé Filipe maaɠoolii zu. Ti ɠɛai ma pelei zu, é ná-kaladopoiti gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Nuiti ta ɠɛɛzu nà ga ɓɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Tanigaa ti ɠɛ, ɗa ga Zan Ɓatisete, zɔiti ti ɠɛ Eli, taɠiligaa ti ɠɛ mɔnɔ, ɗa ga GALA goo wo nui ta.»<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>É zɛba é ti ɠaazaɠa, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wɔun, wa ma, wo ɠɛ nà ga ɓɛ?» Piyɛlɛ gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa è ga Mesi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>É ti laa maaɓakpani ga ti mina naa wo nu nɔpɛ ma.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu saa vai ta buzeɠe vai wo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-23">Matiyo 16:21-23</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:21-22">Luke 9:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>É tɔɔzeini ga é ɗa ti ɠala ga, kɛni Nu ná-Doun Zunui kpɔlɔ mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔ, totuɠɔiti ti ɠɛlɛ ba ta zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti, naa ʋɛɛ tɔ kalamɔinti ba. Kɛni ti paa, naa ʋolu é wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya folo saʋagɔ ʋoluma. <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>É naati boni ti ma, su ɠɛ kala. Piyɛlɛ zɛba é seɠe, é lii la yɛ, é tɔɔzei ga é ɗa zelii lo ma. <verse eid="MRK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu latini, é wɛlɛ ná-kaladopoiti ba, é zelii lo Piyɛlɛ ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Maaɠooza bà, Setana! Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-ɠisiɛiti ti la ga GALA nɔnɔ, kɛlɛ ta ga nuɓusɛ ɠisiɛiti.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu ʋilɛ pelei Yesu ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Matiyo 16:24-28</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luke 9:23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Naa ʋoluma Yesu bɛbɛi lolini, naa ʋɛɛ ná-kaladopoiti ba, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Zɔi é pɔ ga é ʋilɛ pòlu, kɛni é ɠikula ɓɔɠɔ zu, é zaa wului zeɠe, é ʋilɛ pòlu. <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/>Tɔɔzei zɔi é pɔ é zɛnvui ɠizo, naama nui ɠa ʋala ma. Kɛlɛ zɔi a ʋala zɛnvui ma nà-faa zu, ta Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi maaʋele ma, naama nui ɠa zɛnvui ɠizo. <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/>Ni nui ta a etea zɔlɔɔ ganii pɛ sɔlɔɔna, kɛlɛ é ʋala zɛnvui ma, kulanuma ɓɛgele ɠa é bɛ? <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/>Ɓɛgele ɓɔɠɔɓɔɠɔ ka nu a zoo feezu ga zɛnvui unmɔɔ ganii? <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi a unfe ga ze ta dàawooiti, niizuʋɛ yamani nii zaama, niiti ti ga wooʋalada nuiti ta kotoba nuiti, Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɓalaa ka unfe ga naama nui, siɛgi zu ti ʋaazu la ta geezuɠeela ɲadegaiti, Kɛɛɠɛ ná-lɛbiyai zu.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>É zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, tanigaa ta ʋɛ, ti la zaa, eyɛsu ti ɠaazula GALA ná-masadai ma, é ɗa ʋa ga zɛbɛ wolai.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠaazuʋɛ valibo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matiyo 17:1-13</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luke 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Folo lɔzita leʋegai ma naama vaiti poluma, Yesu Piyɛlɛ ta Zake zeɠeni, é ʋɛɛ Zan ʋa, é li ga tiye yɛ gize ɠaaɠooza golai ta ma. É valiboni ti ɠaazu, <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>kɔba zeɠeiti ti ɠole pepe, ti ɠole ʋelei maa ɗa volo, nu vulu nɔpɛ ge la zooga kɛɠala ani ɠole kulazu eteai nii zu. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Eli ta Moize ti ɠulani kɛlɛma kaladopoiti bɛ, ti ɗa yɛpɛ Yesu ʋɔ.<verse eid="MRK 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Piyɛlɛ ɓɔɛni Yesu ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, soloogɛ ga ade yɛ ʋɛ. Gá kota saʋagɔ lo, gilagi ɠɛ ga ɗɔnɔi, gilagi ɠɛ ga Moize nɔnɔi, zɔi ɠɛ ga Eli nɔnɔi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>É la ɠɛni kwɛɛni nii a bo, tɔɔzei dualuagi ti saʋagɔ pɛ daaveni.<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Tonaɓiingi zeɠe geezuʋɛ, é ti maaɓidi. Wooi ta ɠulani naa zu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nii ɠa é ga nɛ̀ɛbɛ Loun Zunui. À woilo goo ma ɗɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Gaamago kaladopoiti ti ɠaazuwuzeɠeai ma, ti wɛlɛni, ti la mɔ nu ɠili nɔpɛ kaani ɠoba, kɛni Yesu ɠila nɔ.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Ti ɠɛai ma gizei yeizu, Yesu ti laa maaɓakpani ga ti mina naa wo nu nɔpɛ ma, nii ti kaani, aisa Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋa wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya. <verse eid="MRK 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Ti ɠoloni naama levei ʋɛ, kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠasu naama wooi ʋoluʋɛ ma ga: «É wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya», naa ʋolu ɠa ga leeni?<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Ti niima ɠaazaɠagi woni da, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu mu tɔ kalamɔinti ti ɠɛɛzu ma, kɛni mɔunpa Eli a ʋaana dɛ ʋolu?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gaama ʋe, Eli maanɛɛʋɛ ga é ʋa, é fai pɛ sei kpasu ga pagɔ. Kɛlɛ lee vaa zu mu, GALA Sɛʋɛi bosu ga kɛni Nu ná-Doun Zunui kpɔlɔ mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔ, naa ʋoluma ti ɓaaɠula ma? <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un, nà bosu wo ma ga: Eli mu paaʋɛ niina, kɛlɛ ti naa zoni ga ʋelei ti ɠɛni pɔ la, eɠɛʋelei GALA Sɛʋɛi ɓɔɛai la, é lo ba.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inɛ su loungoi ɠɛdɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matiyo 17:14-21</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luke 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Ti maaɓuɠaai ma kaladopoi zɔiti ba, ti bɛbɛ wolai ɠaani naati maaɠoolii zu, tɔ kalamɔinti ti ɠɛni kpɔɛi zuɠulazu ti ma. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Naama nuiti ti Yesu ɠaai ma nɔ feya, ti wola laavɔɔni, ti ɓizɛ ga daaɠomiga, tuʋɔ fai zu.<verse eid="MRK 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>É kaladopoiti gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Lee ɠa wo suɠulazu, wa nuuti?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Bɛbɛi naa zaama zunui ta gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, pàaʋɛ è ʋɔ ga dòun zunui, mazɔlɔɔ zɛnvu ɲɔi ɠa ɗa zeɠe la, é kɛ ga ɓoɓoi. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Ʋɛ nɔpɛ zɛnvu ɲɔi ɠa seɠena ná, toɠa ɗa foɓe zooi ma, doungoi laaɗɛ ɲagi ɗa ʋu, é ɗa ɲiigaiti siɛ ga, é ɓaa su soolii. Gè ɗa-ɠaladopoiti maanɛɛnɛʋɛ ga ti kpɛ su, kɛlɛ ti la zooni.»<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Ee, kidaaleʋelala nuɓusɛiti, nà yɛsu wo ʋa dɛ, eyɛsu yeelɛ? Nà yeezei wo wu, eyɛsu yeelɛ? À ʋa pɔ̀ ga doungoi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Ti ʋaani ga doungoi pɔ. Tɛi zɛnvu ɲɔi Yesu ɠaani nɔ feya, é doungoi ɓalini ga gola, é foɓe zooi ma, naa ɗa ɠilikili zooi ma, daaɗɛ ɲagi ɗa ʋu.<verse eid="MRK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Yesu doun kɛɛɠɛi ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Nii tɔɔzeiʋɛ siɛ kpɛgele zu?» Doun kɛɛɠɛi ɠɛ ma: «Kaite ma loungo ziɛ su. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai tanigaa zu vɔlɔ inɛgi ɠa ɗa daaʋili abui zu, ɓaa ziɛi wu, nii a kɛ é naa ʋaa. Ni ɗa zoo faa ɠɛɛzu su, gi ɠaazumaawɔinɠa, è ɓɔ gi ʋa!» <verse eid="MRK 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu è ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Ni ɗa zoo faa ɠɛɛzu su?› Fai pɛ ka ga kɛɛ vaa naama nui ʋɛ, nii ladalai zea.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Gaamago doun kɛɛɠɛi wooɠulani, é ɠɛ ma: «Dàaʋɛ da, kɛlɛ ɓɔ bà kae nà-ladalalai zu!»<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Yesu bɛbɛi ɠaai ma, é ɗa ɠaalɛ ba ti ɠoba, é devei veeni kɔzɔba yɛnvui ya ga sɛbɛi, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ʋe zɛnvu ɲɔi, ɗɛi è nui woizuɓɔlɔzu, è kɛ ga ɓoɓoi, gè devei vea è ya ga è ɠula doungoi nii zu, è mina mɔ ɠale ma ʋolu, è ʋa lɔ su pɛ-o!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Inɛgi kpee wolai looni, é doungoi ɓali ga zeeɠaaɓaai, é ɠula naa zu. Doungoi yɛni laani eɠɛ a za. Zɔiti vɔlɔ ti ná ɠaani, naati ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «É zaa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu doungoi zoni zeei ʋa, é buzeɠe, naama ge wuzeɠe, é lo ɠɔɠɔiti ga.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Yesu lɛai ma pɛlɛi wu, tɛi ti maaɠelesa ge leʋeni ta ná-kaladopoiti, naati ti gaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu gi la zooni gi ʋa niima inɛgi ɓɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nu la ɗa ga zoo nii ɠɛɠala inɛgi ɓɛɛzu kɛni GALA falii.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu saa vai wo fai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matiyo 17:22-23</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luke 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Ti zeɠeai ma miná, ti Galilé yooi maaɓudɛni, kɛlɛ Yesu la ɠɛni pɔ ga nu suɠwɛɛ, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>mazɔlɔɔ é ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti kalasu. É ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ti ma: «Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa ʋaazu lɔɔzu nuiti zeezu, ti paa. Kɛlɛ folo saʋagɔ saai ʋoluma, toɠa wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Kɛlɛ naati mu ti la ɠɛni naama ɓɔɛi ɠaaɠaani, tama ti ɠɛni luazu ga ti ʋa gaazaɠa.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛ ɠa bɔɔlɔai ɛsɛ pɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matiyo 18:1-5</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luke 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Ti zeelini Kapɛɛlɛnawume. Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni la pɛlɛi wu, Yesu ti ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Leeni ɠa wo ɠɛa suɠulazu pelei zu?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Kɛlɛ ti maaɠɛni kpɔ, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛai ma pelei zu, ti ɠɛni yɛpɛzu, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga ti zaama, ɓɛ ɠa bɔɔlɔai ti pɛ ba.<verse eid="MRK 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Yesu zeini, é zɛba é keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) toli, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Zɔi nɔpɛ é pɔ ga é ɠɛ ga nu mɔungi, kɛni dɛ é ɠɛ ga nu ɠaaɓelagi, ta é ɠɛ ga ɛsɛ pɛ ná-botiɠɛ nui.»<verse eid="MRK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Naa ʋoluma, é doungoi ta zeɠeni, é pilɛ ti zaama. É naa nɛɛnɛni, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/>«Zɔi nɔpɛ a yeezei doungoi ta wu eɠɛ nii, nɔ̀un maaʋele ma, naama nui yeezeiɗa bù, nà ɓɔɠɔi. Zɔi a yeezei bù, nà lɛi é ʋa yeezei bù, kɛlɛ nui é tèʋegai, naa ɠa é yeezeiɗai bu.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɔi é la ade laalɔɠɔma, naa ɠa ade ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luke 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Zan ɠɛni ma: «Kalamɔn, gi zunui ta ɠaaʋɛ, é ɗa inɛgiti kpɛ è-laaseigi zu. Gi ɠɛni pɔ ga gi pele leʋe tuɠɔ, mazɔlɔɔ é la ʋilɛsu ade ʋolu.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ɠɛni ma: «À mina pele leʋe tuɠɔ, tɔɔzei nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa laavɔɔ vaa ɠɛ dàaseigi zu, kpega ʋoluma nɔ feya ga woo ɲɔiti bo dàalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/>Zɔi é la ade laalɔɠɔma, naa ɠa ade ʋa. <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ é ziɛ ɠɔɠɔ ɲɛ gila feezu wo ya ga wo ɓɔɔle, tɔɔzei wa ga Kilista nɔnɔ, gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, naama nui la ʋalaga ná-kulanumai ma.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu loo vai kotoi zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matiyo 18:6-9</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luke 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>«Doungoi niiti kpein ti laai nɔ̀un da, zɔi nɔpɛ a ti ɠila kpalaa toona kotoi zu, a la vizɔ naama nui ma ga kɔtu wolai ɠili kɔgi ʋa, ti pili kpoloɗɛi wu. <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/>Ni è-yeei ɠa é è loozu kotoi zu, teʋe ɓɔɠɔ ʋa. Tɔɔzei fizɔgɛ è ma ga è lɔ ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zu ga è maalɛɠɛfɛgai, kɛlɛ è-yee felegɔi mina yɛ è ʋa, è ʋa li undaaʋili abui zu, nii é la zaazu pɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/>[Miná, koegi niiti ti nuiti miizu ná, ti la zaa pɛ, ta abui ɓalaa la zaa ná pɛ.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/>Ni è-ɠɔɠɔi ɠa é è loozu kotoi zu, teʋe ɓɔɠɔ ʋa. Tɔɔzei fizɔgɛ è ma ga è lɔ ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zu ga è maalɛɠɛfɛgai, kɛlɛ è-ɠɔɠɔ felegɔi mina yɛ è ʋa, è ʋa ʋili undaaʋili abui zu. <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>[Miná, koegi niiti ti nuiti miizu ná, ti la zaa pɛ, ta abui ɓalaa la zaa ná pɛ.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/>Ni è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ɠa é è loozu kotoi zu, kula su. Tɔɔzei fizɔgɛ è ma ga è lɔ GALA ná-masadai zu ga è-ɠaazu ɠila kpe nɔ, è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛ felegɔiti gaavɔnigai ʋa yɛ è ya, ɗa ma è ʋili undaaʋili abui zu. <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/>Miná, koegi niiti ti nuiti miizu ná, ti la zaa pɛ, ta abui ɓalaa la zaa ná pɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>Tɔɔzei abui ɠa ʋu ɛsɛ pɛ ba eɠɛ kpoloi. <verse eid="MRK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>Kpoloi ʋagɛ. Kɛlɛ ni kpoloi ná-ɲɛmigi ɠa ɠulana ba, nu ɠa leʋe ɠale, é ʋa nɛɛ ʋolu? Kpoloi maanɛɛʋɛ é ɠɛ wa ɓɔɠɔi wo-ɠɔlɔ su, naa ʋoluma ziilɛigi ɠɛ wo pɛ wo yɔɠɔzu.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Kalagi Yesu boni <optbreak/> é ʋilɛ vulu zaa vai ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matiyo 19:1-12</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luke 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Yesu zeɠeni miná, é li Zudé yooi zu, ʋɛ ná Zuludɛn ʋoluʋelei. Bɛbɛi ɠaalɛɛni ba mɔnɔ miná koba. Tama ʋelei nɔ a ɗa kɛɛ la pɔlɔma, é tɔɔzeini ga é ɗa kalagi ve ti ya.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>Faliziɛin tanigaa ti maaɓuɠani ba, nii a kɛ ti suɠɔɠɔ ga gaazaɠagi, ti ɠɛni ma: «Tɔgi vaaʋɛ nɛi bu ga zunui ɠɛlɛ anzai ʋa?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Devei ɓɛgele ɠa Moize feai wo ya?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Moize vaaʋɛ bu ga zunui vulu zaa zɛʋɛi ve anzai ya, ti bali ma ta naa.»<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Wa-ɠikpaai maaʋele ɠa Moize naama levei zɛʋɛai la wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/>Kɛlɛ eteai ɓɛtɛ ziɛgi zu, ‹GALA ge nuɓusɛi ɓɛtɛni, zunui ta anzanui.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Zen 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/>‹Naa ɠa é ba, zunui ɠa zeɠe kɛɛɠɛ ta dee ʋa, é ɠili anzai ʋa, <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/>ti felegɔ ta ɠɛ ga kpusɛ ɠila.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Zen 2:24</ref></char>.</char></note> Naazu ti la mɔ ga nu felegɔ, ta niina ga kpusɛ ɠila kpe. <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nu nɔpɛ ge mina naa ɠaaɠwɛ, nii GALA ge kpɔgai su.»<verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠaleni ma la pɛlɛi wu, kaladopoiti ti gaazaɠani ʋolu naama vaa ɠilagi nɔ ma. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Zɔi nɔpɛ é ɠɛlɛzu anzai ʋa, é taɠili sei, naa wɛɛnziɛgi ɠɛa anza mɔungi laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/>Ʋele nɔ ɠana é la ɓalaa, ni anzanui ɠa ɠɛlɛna sinigi ʋa, é zei taɠili bɛ, é wɛɛnziɛgi ɠɛa.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu yeezei vai doungoiti bu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matiyo 19:13-15</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luke 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Nuiti ti ʋaani ga doungoiti Yesu ʋɔ, nii a kɛ é yeela ti ma. Kɛlɛ kaladopoiti ti ɠɛni zelii losu naama nuiti ma. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Yesu miná ɠaai ma, é wanani ma. É ɠɛni ti ma: «À ɓe doungoiti ba, ti ʋa pɔ̀. À mina pele leʋe ti luɠɔ, tɔɔzei GALA ná-masadai ɠa ga naati tɔnɔ, niiti ti ga ti ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, zɔi nɔpɛ é la yeezeini GALA ná-masadai wu ga doungoi ɠɛʋele, naama nui la lɔa su pɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>É zɛba é doungoiti seɠe, é ti la yeeloko zu, é yeela ti ma, é tuya loo ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naavolo nuiti ta GALA ná-masadai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matiyo 19:16-30</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luke 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Tɛi Yesu ɠɛni pele zosu, zunui ta ɓizɛni, é ʋa, é ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa kɔɠɔwu, é gaazaɠa, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn ʋagɔi, leeni ɠa maanɛai ga gè kɛ, gè ʋa ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zɔlɔɔ ga nɔ̀nɔ?»<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Lee vaa zu è tòlisu ga nu ʋagɔi? Nu nɔpɛ ge la ʋani, kɛni GALA gila kpe. <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/>È deveiti kwɛni: Mina nu ʋaa, mina wɛɛnziɛ bo, mina unma wo, mina zɛɛ zeele woo wo, mina faa ɲɔu ɠɛ ga nu nɔpɛ, è-ɠɛɛ lɛbi ta è-lee.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Ɛgz 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">TSV 5:16-20</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Zunui ɠɛni ma: «Kalamɔn, gè naama leveiti pɛ soga kaite mà loungo ziɛgi zu.»<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Yesu pɛtɛgai ma, é nɛɛni ʋɛ, é zɛba é ɠɛ ma: «Faa ɠila ka dɛ ʋoluzu, nii è la dɛ kɛɛni: Li, è è-ɠɔligiti pɛ pɔdi, è ma naavoloi ve bala nuiti bɛ, naazu ɗa naavolo zɔlɔɔ geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Naa ʋoluma, ʋa, è ʋilɛ pòlu.»<verse eid="MRK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Zunui naama wooi mɛnigai ma, gaazuɠilini, é li ga ziiɓɔlɔi, tɔɔzei kɔligi wola mɔinni.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Yesu wɛlɛni ná-kaladopoiti ba, naa ʋoluma é ɠɛ ti ma: «Kpɛtɛ nuiti dɔɔ vai wola ɓaaʋɛ GALA ná-masadai zu!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Kaladopoiti ti laavɔɔni ga naama wooiti. Kɛlɛ Yesu ɠɛni ma mɔnɔ: «Dòinti, GALA ná-masadai zulɔɔ vai wola ɓaaʋɛ. <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/>Ɲɔmɛi leʋe fai la ɓaani sɛɠilɛ zeɠei zu, é ʋa zeeli kpɛtɛ nui lɔɔ vai zu GALA ná-masadai zu.»<verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Naa kaladopoiti mɔta laavɔɔni, ti zɛba ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga: «Ɓɛ ɠa mu a zoo ɠizosu?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Yesu wɛlɛni ti ʋa, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Naa la zooga é ʋa ɠɛ nuɓusɛiti zea, kɛlɛ é la ɠana GALA zea. Fai pɛ ka zoo ɠɛɛzu GALA zea.»<verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Piyɛlɛ zɛba é gaazaɠa, é ɠɛ ma: «Gá ma? Gi fai pɛ zɛga ná, gi ʋilɛ è ʋolu.»<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, zɔi nɔpɛ é zeɠezu ná-pɛlɛi ʋa, ɓaa kɛɛlointi ta baazeelaiti ba, ɓaa deeni ta kɛɛni ba, ɓaa ná-dointi, ɓaa ná-tii ɠɛɛzuʋɛti ba, nɔ̀un maaʋele ma ta Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi, <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/>ma nui ɠa ʋaazu naati ma ʋɛɛda ungilagilagi zɔlɔɔsu niima yeeɠɛɠalai zu: pɛlɛiti, naa ʋɛɛ ɠɛɛɠɛlointi ta zeelaiti ba, ta deeiti, ta lointi, naa ʋɛɛ tii ɠɛɛzuʋɛti ba. Kɛlɛ wɔinzeɠemai ɠa ʋɛɛ naati pɛ ba. Tama etea niinɛi zu é ʋaazu, naama nui ɠa ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/>Kɛlɛ nu mɔungiti ma mɔinmɔin ka ɠɛ ga ma ɠaaɓelagiti, tama ma ɠaaɓelagiti ma mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛ ga ma mɔungiti.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu saa vai ta buzeɠe vai wo fai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matiyo 20:17-19</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luke 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Ti ɠɛni pelei ma, ti ɗa lɛ Zeluzalɛme. Yesu ɠa é ɠɛni ti luɠɔ. Kaladopoiti ti laavɔɔni, dualuagi lɔ nui niiti su, ti ɠɛni ga ti ʋoluʋelei. Yesu zɛba é keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) toli yɛ, ti maaɠelesa ge leʋe, é tɔɔzei ga naa woga, nii maanɛai é zeeli ma. É ɠɛni ti ma: <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>«À woilo, ada lɛɛzu Zeluzalɛme. Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa ʋaazu lɔɔzu zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti zeezu ta tɔ kalamɔinti. Ta ná-tukpɔi ɠaaleʋe ga é za, ti seɠe, ti dɔ zii ɠiligiti zeezu. <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/>Ta ɲɛɛɠula su, ti laaɗɛi ʋu ma, ti doɠa ga kpakɔi, ti paa. Naa ʋoluma folo saʋagɔ ʋoluma, toɠa wuzeɠe, é ɠula saai ya.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeɓedé ná-doun zunuiti ta-maanɛɛnɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matiyo 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Zeɓedé ná-doun zunuiti, Zake ta Zan, ti maaɓuɠani Yesu ʋa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, gá pɔ ga nii gi falizu è ma, è naa ɠɛ gi ʋɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Ɓɛgele ɠa wo pɔ ga gè kɛ wo ʋɛ?»<verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠɛna ɗa-lɛbiyai zu, va bu ga gi zei è ɠoba, gilagi ɠɛ è yeezazuʋɛ, zɔi ɠɛ è ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Wo la kwɛɛ nii wo falizu ɠana. Wa zoo nɛi wo ɓɔɔle ga soolɛi ma ɗaawɔi nii gè ɓɔɔlezu la, ɓaa wo lɔ ɓatizei naa zu, nii nà lɔ su?»<verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Eyei, gá zoo naa la.» Yesu zɛba é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gaama ʋe, wa ɓɔɔle ga ziawɔi nii gè ɓɔɔlezu la, ta ɓatizei nà ziɛ bu, wa ziɛ naa wu ɓalaa. <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/>Kɛlɛ nii é ga sei wo fai kòba zèezazuʋɛ ta kɔ̀ʋɛzuʋɛ, naama zobo ge la veeni zèa ga gè fe. Naama zeizuʋɛti ta ga naama nuiti tɔnɔ, niiti GALA ge ti makɛgai ti ʋɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Kaladopo puugɔi zɔiti ti naama wooi mɛnigai ma, nii Zake ta Zan ti boni, é wanani ti ma. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Yesu zɛba é ti pɛ toli ɠoba, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo kwɛni nii a ɗa ɠɛ zooiti su: Niiti ti ga zou ɠundiɠiiti, naati ta ɗa zei nuɓusɛiti unga, nu ɓiigiti ti ɗa zei ti unga ga ta-zobogi. <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/>Wɔun, naa ta mina ɠɛ wo zaama. Kɛlɛ tɔun ni nui ta ɠa pɔ é ɠɛ ga nu ɓii gola wo zaama, kɛni é ɠɛ ga wo pɛ wa-wotiɠɛ nui. <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/>Zɔi é pɔ é ɠɛ ga nu mɔungi wo zaama, kɛni naa ɠɛ ga ɛsɛ pɛ ná-duɔi. <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, anɛɛ Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋe, é la ʋaani ga nu ʋa botii ɠɛ bɛ, kɛlɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi mu paaʋɛ ga é botii ɠɛɛ nuiti bɛ, é zɛnvui ve ga nu mɔinmɔin unmɔɔ saɓui.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaazuɠole nui ʋalo vai Zeliko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matiyo 20:29-34</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luke 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Ti zeelini Zeliko. Siɛgi zu Yesu ɠɛni ɠulazu la Zeliko ʋa ta ná-kaladopoiti, naa ʋɛɛ bɛbɛ wolai ʋa, Timé ná-doun zunui Ɓaaletimé ɠɛni zeini pele ɠobaʋɛ, gaazuɠoleai, é ɗa falii wo. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Siɛgi zu é mɛnini da ga Nazalɛte nui Yesu ɠa é leʋesu, é tɔɔzeini ga kpeei loa, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Davide ná-Doun Zunui, Yesu, gàazumaawɔinɠa!»<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Nu mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni zelii losu ma ga é maaɠɛ kpɔ, kɛlɛ tɔun é ɠɛni wooɠulazu sɛsɛ, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Davide ná-Doun Zunui, gàazumaawɔinɠa!»<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Yesu loni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À toli dɛɛ, é ʋa.» Ti gaazuɠole nui lolini, ti ɠɛ ma: «Zɛbɛzeɠe, wuzeɠe, é ɠɛ è ʋa.» <verse eid="MRK 10:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Naama wooi mɛnigai ma bɛ, é ná-seɠe wolai ʋilini ya, é wuzeɠe, é sakpa ga Yesu ʋɔ pelei.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Lee ɠa è pɔ ga gè kɛ è ʋɛ?» Gaazuɠole nui gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, va bu ga gè wozaɠaa ʋolu.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Liina. Tɛi è laa dà, è ʋaloa.» Gaamago nɔ, é wozaɠaani ʋolu, é ʋilɛ Yesu ʋolu pelei zu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lɛɛ vai Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matiyo 21:1-11</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luke 19:28-40</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Zan 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Siɛgi zu ti maaɓuɠani la Zeluzalɛme ʋa, Ɓɛtefazé ta Ɓetani ti ɠɛɠalaʋɛ, Wolive wulu ɓelei ma ɠizei ɠobaʋɛ, Yesu ná-kaladopo felegɔ leʋeni, <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>é ɠɛ ti ma: «À li taa goi nii zu, é wo luɠɔ. Wa lɛɛna nɔ feya taazuʋɛ, wa soovale ziʋoi ta ɠaazu, giliai, nii nu nɔpɛ ge la dɛ zeini kɔma. À fie, wo ʋaa la ʋɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/>Ni nu a wo ɠaazaɠana ga: ‹Lee vaa zu wo naa ɠɛɛzu?›, à ɠɛ ma: ‹Màliɠii ɓɛdɛi ɠa ba, tama toɠa gaaɠalesu ma ɠani nɔ.› »<verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Ti liini, ti soovale ziʋoi ta ɠa giliai eteaʋɛ, koi yɔɠɔzuʋɛ, pɛlɛlaʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ. Ti fieni. <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Nui niiti ti ɠɛni ná, naa tanigaa ti ɠɛni ti ma: «Lee ɠa wo kɛɛzu, wo soovale ziʋoi viesu?»<verse eid="MRK 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Ti gooɠaaʋotegi veeni, ʋelei Yesu boni la ti ma. Tama, ti ti yɛni ná, ti lii la. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Ti liini ga soovale ziʋoi Yesu ʋɔ, ti ta-zeɠe wolaiti pɛ kɔma, Yesu lɛ, é zei kɔma. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Nu mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni ta-zeɠe wolaiti pɛɛzu pelei zu, tanigaa ti ɗa gulu ɓeke kpifɔgiti teʋe dɔɓɔi zu, ti ɗa ti ʋɛɛ pelei zu. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Bɛbɛi nii pɛ é ɠɛni ziɛzu Yesu luɠɔʋelei, ta poluʋelei, ti ɠɛni wooɠulazu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:9">«Ozana!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ozana</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Maamusɛ wooi nii poluʋɛ ga «kizo fai ve».</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:9">Maliɠii tuya loo naama nui ʋɛ, nii é ʋaazu daaseigi zu!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Guy 118:25-26</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>GALA ge tuya loo masadai ʋɛ, é ʋaazu, ade-mɛmɛwola Davide ná-masadai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:10">Ozana GALA bɛ geeɠɔlɔgi ungaʋɛ!»<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Yesu zeeliai ma Zeluzalɛme, é liini GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, é faiti pɛtɛ ga pagɔ, niiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ná. Naa ʋoluma tɛi kpidii ɠɛni niina ʋɛɛzu, ti ɠulani taai ʋa ta ná-keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12), ti li Ɓetani.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kooleɠoole gului ɠoto vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matiyo 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Poluma zobui, tɛi ti ɠɛni zeɠezu Ɓetani ta naati, pului soni. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>É kooleɠoole gului ta ɠaani ɠoozama, gaalaagi ɓiiliai ga. É liini gului naa ʋɔ pelei, nii a kɛ é pɛtɛ ni toɠa ma waai ta ɠa ga é mi. Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu é maaɓuɠani la gului ʋa, ma laa tetelegi nɔ ɠa é kaani ga, tɔɔzei kooleɠoolegi waa ziɛgi la ɠɛni dɛ zeelini. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>É zɛba é ɠɛ gului ma: «Eyɛsu pɛ nu nɔpɛ ge mina mɔ è-ɠaawaai ta mi!» Ná-kaladopoiti ti goomɛnini, é ɗa naa wo.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pɔdi loo nuiti kpɛɛ vai <optbreak/> GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matiyo 21:12-17</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luke 19:45-48</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Zan 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Ti zeelini Zeluzalɛme. Yesu lɛɛni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, é tɔɔzei ga pɔdi loo nuiti pɛ kpɛa ná. É wali valibo nuiti ta-laɓaliiti tokani, naa ʋɛɛ poopo pɔdi nuiti ta-ɓɔkpɔgiti ba. <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>É la ɠɛni kɛɛni, nu ʋa leʋe ga ani nɔpɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɓɔɛni ɛsɛ pɛ pɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «É la zɛʋɛni GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ɓaa, ga: ‹Nà-pɛlɛi ɠa loli ga GALA fali ʋɛlɛi ziiti pɛ bɛ›?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Eza 56:7</ref></char>.</char></note> Kɛlɛ wɔun, wo ná ɠɛa ga toosu nuiti dɔɔɠuzuʋɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Zel 7:11</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta tɔ kalamɔinti ti naama vai mɛnini, nii é ɠɛɛni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. Ti zɛba ti tɔɔzei ga keleɠele gaiziaa ga ti Yesu ʋa, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni luazu ba, mazɔlɔɔ kalagi nii é ɠɛni feezu, naa ɠɛni faa wola ʋaazu nuɓusɛiti ma. <verse eid="MRK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Kpɔkɔi zeeliai ma, Yesu ta ná-kaladopoiti ti ɠulani taai ʋa.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalagi é zɔlɔɔsu kooleɠoolegi ʋa, nii é vɔɔni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matiyo 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Poluma zobui, ti leʋesuʋɛ, ti kooleɠoole gului ɠaani pele ɠobaʋɛ, fɔai, é zeeli ma zapeiti ma. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠi ge looni naa zu, nii é ɠɛɛni, é zɛba é ɠɛ Yesu ma: «Kalamɔn! Wɛlɛ kooleɠoole gului ʋa, nii è kotoni, é vɔa kpaankpaan!»<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «À la GALA da. <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, ni nui ta a ɠɛɛna gizei nii ma: ‹Wuzeɠe miná, è ʋili kpoloɗɛi wu,› ni é la inɛinɛni ziimaʋɛ, kɛlɛ é la da ga nii é bogai, toɠa ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu, naama vai ɠa ɠɛ nɔ bɛ ti. <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà bosu wo ma ga: Nii nɔpɛ wa falina, wa-ƓALA falii zu, à la da niina ga wo sɔlɔɔga, tama toɠa ɠɛ nɔ wo ʋɛ ti. <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/>Wa ɠɛna loni ga wo GALA fali, ni faa ta ma zii nɔpɛ ka wo yiima, nui ta laalɔɠɔma, à suvaayɛ, nii a kɛ wo-Ɠɛɛ, nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é wo zuvaayɛ wa ɓalaa ga wa-vaa ɲɔiti. <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/>[Kɛlɛ ni wo la suvaayɛgi woni, wo-Ɠɛɛ nii é geeɠɔlɔgi zu, tɔ ɓalaa é la wo zuvaayɛga ga wa-vaa ɲɔiti.]»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mini ɠa Yesu ná-zobogi zeɠezu ná?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matiyo 21:23-27</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luke 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Ti ɠaleni ma Zeluzalɛme. Yesu ɠɛai ma leʋesu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoi zaamaʋɛ, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta tɔ kalamɔinti, naa ʋɛɛ totuɠɔiti ba, ti maaɓuɠani ba, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>«Zobo kpɛgele ɠa è niima vaiti kɛɛzu la? Ɓɛ ɠa é ma zobogi vea è ya?»<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Nà ɓalaa, gaazaɠa gila ka bɛ̀ ga gè bo wo ma. Ni wa gòoɠaaʋotena, nà ɓalaa, zobogi nii gè niima vaiti kɛɛzu bu, nà naa zeɠezuʋɛ lɛ ga woye niina: <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/>Ɓɛ ɠa é zobogi veeni Zan ʋɛ ga é ɗa ɓatizei wo? GALA ge ɠɛni de, ɓaa nuiti kɛni de? À gòoɠaaʋote dɛɛ!»<verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Ti yɛ sulatilatisu yɔɠɔzu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ni ada ɠɛɛna ma: ‹GALA ge ɠɛni de,› toɠa ɠɛ ade ma: ‹Lee vaa zu mu wo la ɠɛni laani Zan la?› <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Kɛlɛ ada ɠɛɛna ma mɔnɔ: ‹Nuiti kɛni de›?» Ti ɠɛni luazu bɛbɛi ná-ziiɠulai ʋa, tɔɔzei ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛni devezu ga Zan ɠɛni ga GALA goo wo nu ɠiteɠite. <verse eid="MRK 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Ti zɛba ti Yesu wooɠaaʋote, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi la kwɛni.» Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Nɔ̀un nà ɓalaa gè la zobogi nii zeɠezu lɛa ga woye pɛ, nii gè niima vaiti kɛɛzu la.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Faalaalii é ʋilɛ <optbreak/> kpele makɛ nu ɲɔiti ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matiyo 21:33-46</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luke 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Naa ʋoluma, Yesu tɔɔzeini ga é ɗa ɓɔɛ ti ʋɔ faalaaliiti su, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Zunu ɠila ge leezɛn ɓelei laani, é maaɠaku ga sasai, é kɔɠɛi lo ná dɔɔi ɠula vai zu, é pɛlɛ ɠaaɠooza golai lo ná maaɓɛɛ vai zu. Naa pɛ poluma, é kpelei ɠalivaani kpele makɛ nua ma, é li zou ɠili su. <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/>Naama waai ɠula yeeɠɛɠalai zeeliai ma, é botiɠɛ nu leʋeni kpele makɛ nuiti ma, ga ti daamiizuʋɛ ve kpele ɠaawaai zu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/>Kɛlɛ kpele makɛ nuiti ti valani ná-botiɠɛ nui ʋa, ti doɠa, ti zeaɲakai ɠaaɠale ma. <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/>Kpele kɛɛ nui botiɠɛ nui velesiɛi leʋeni ʋolu. Kɛlɛ ti naa loɠani nɔungi zu, ti ɗa poomu. <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/>Kpele kɛɛ nui zɛba é botiɠɛ nui zaʋasiɛi leʋe, ti naa ʋaa. Naa ʋolu é ma mɔinmɔin kiligaa leʋeni, ti tanigaa loɠa, ti zɔiti paa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>Gaaɓelagi, nu ɠila kpe nɔ niina é yɛni zea ga é teʋe ti ma, naa ɠɛni ga nɛɛbɛ loun zunui. É naa leʋeni, é ɗa ɠisiɛ ga: ‹Ta unfe dòun zunui ma.› <verse eid="MRK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>Kɛlɛ kpele makɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ma: ‹Pogani zeɠe nui ɠa. Ade paa, de ná-poganii zeɠe ga adɔnɔ.› <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/>Ti soni, ti paa, ti pili ya kpelei ʋoluʋelei. <verse eid="MRK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>Lee ɠa kpele kɛɛ nui a kɛ? Toɠa ʋa, é kpele makɛ nuiti paa, naa ʋoluma é kpelei ɠaliva taɠiligaa ma.»<verse eid="MRK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Kaipa wo la dɛ niima wooi ɠalani GALA sɛʋɛiti su:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‹Kɔtui nii pɛlɛ lo nuiti ti ɠɛlɛni ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">naa ɠa kɛai ga sɔɓelama ɠɔtu wolai.<verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>Maliɠii ɠa é niima vai ɠɛa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">tama toɠa ga laavɔɔ vaa ade ɠaazu›?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10-11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Guy 118:22-23</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Ti ɠɛni keleɠele gaiziɛzu ga ti Yesu zo, kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni luazu bɛbɛi ʋa. Tɔɔzei ti gaaɠaani ga tiya ɠa Yesu faalaalii naa wogai ta-vaa zu. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni ti zɛni ná, ti zeɠe koba.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mului zala vai Sezaal ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matiyo 22:15-22</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luke 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Ti numaa leʋeni ma Faliziɛinti saama, naa ʋɛɛ Elɔde ʋolu nui tanigaa ʋa, nii a kɛ ti so ga kpɔɛzuɠulai. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Ti ʋaani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn, gi kwɛni ga ɗa gaama wosu. È la vaazu bu nu ʋa è zeɠe è-ziɛ ʋele ʋa, tɔɔzei è la wɛlɛzu nuiti tosuʋɛ nɔ ʋa. Ɗa kalagi wosu ga gaamai pɛ, é lo naa ʋa, ʋelei GALA ge pɔ ga nu ziɛ la. Bo gi ma mu: Tɔgi vaaʋɛ nɛi bu ga nu mului zala Wɔlɔme masagi Sezaal ma, ɓaa nu mina sala ma?»<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ɠɛni kwɛɛni ga ta ga woovele nuiti, é ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo sùɠɔɠɔsu? À ʋaa lɛɛ pɔ̀ ga wali ɠae gila, gè ka.»<verse eid="MRK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Ti ʋaani ga gila. É ti ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ɓɛ maaniini ta daasei ka é ma?» Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Sezaal ʋe.» <verse eid="MRK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>É ɠɛni ti ma naazu: «Nii é ga Sezaal nɔnɔi, à naa ve Sezaal ya, nii é ga GALA nɔnɔi, wo naa ve GALA zea.» Ti laavɔɔni ga ná-gooɠaaʋotegi.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maaɠaalii é lo gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai ʋa saai ya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matiyo 22:23-33</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luke 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Saduseyɛinti ti ʋaani pɔ bɛ. Naati ka ti ɠɛ gɔvɛiti ti la wuzeɠezu, ti ʋa ɠula saai ya. Ti niima ɠaazaɠagi woni da, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>«Kalamɔn, Moize ná-sɛʋɛiti su, é niima levei veeni ade ya, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Ni zunui ta kɛɛɠɛloin a zaana, é anzai yɛ, kɛlɛ é la doun yɛni ga ʋoluʋelei, zunui naa maanɛɛʋɛ ga é ná-poanzai zei ga anza, nii a kɛ é kɛɛɠɛloin ma zuwui makɛ.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">TSV 25:5</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Tama, ɠɛɛɠɛloun lɔfela ɠɛni ná. Ma mɔungi vului ɠɛɛni, é za, é la doun yɛni. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Felesiɛi poanzai zeɠeni, naa ɓalaa za, é la doun yɛni. Ʋele nɔ ɠana saʋasiɛi kɛɛni la. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Ti lɔfela pɛ ti zaani, ti la doun yɛni. Gaaɓelasu, anzanui ɓalaa za. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Siɛgi zu niina gɔvɛiti ti wuzeɠezu la, ti ɠula saai ya, ɓɛ ɠa nɔnɔ ɠa ɠɛ ga anzai? Tɔɔzei seiʋɛ ti lɔfela pɛ bɛ ga anza.»<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Wo ɠakagɛ, tɔɔzei wo la GALA sɛʋɛiti gaaɠaazu, wo la GALA ná-zɛbɛi ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/>Tɔɔzei siɛgi zu buzeɠei wosu da, nu ɠula saai ya, zunuiti ti la mɔ anza zeɠea, anzanuiti ti la mɔ zeiɗa zini bɛ, ta ɠɛɛzu niina eɠɛ geezuɠeelaiti. <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/>Nii é ga gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai, ti ɠula saai ya, kaipa wo la dɛ naama wooi ɠalani Moize ná-sɛʋɛi zu, é lo kpɔvɔ goi ʋa? GALA ge ɠɛni ma: ‹Nà ɠa gè ga Abalaame, Izaake, ta Zakɔɓe ta-ƓALAGI.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Ɛgz 3:6</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 3:15">15</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/>GALA ge la ga gɔvɛiti ta-ƓALA, kɛlɛ toɠa ga fulu nuiti ta-ƓALAGI. Gaamazu wo ɠakagɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi nii kpaɠoai tɔgi pɛ ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matiyo 22:34-40</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luke 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Tɔ kalamɔin gila ge ti woomɛnini, ti ɗa kpɔɛi zuɠula, ta é kaani ga Yesu Saduseyɛinti gooɠaaʋotegɛ ga pagɔ. É Yesu ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Devei ɓɛgele ɠa kpaɠoai zɔiti pɛ ba?»<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Wɛlɛ devei nii ɠa gola vizɔgai zɔiti pɛ ba: ‹À woilo, Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti! Maliɠii ɠa é ga da-ƓALAGI, tɔ ɠa é ga GALA gila kpegi. <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/>Ɗa Maliɠii ɗa-ƓALAGI nɛɛ ʋɛ ga è-yii pɛ, ta è-yɛnvui pɛ, naa ʋɛɛ ɗa-ɠisiɛi ta è-zuvikɛi pɛ ba.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:29-30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 6:4-5">TSV 6:4-5</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/>Felesiɛi ɠa é ga nii: ‹Ɗa è-zeiɲɔɠɔi nɛɛ ʋɛ, eɠɛ ɗa ɓɔɠɔi.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref></char>.</char></note> Deve ɠili ge la ná, nii kpaɠoai naati felegɔi ʋa.»<verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>Tɔ kalamɔin ɠɛni ma: «Kalamɔn, è gaamai wogɛ ga GALA ka ɠila kpe nɔ, taɠili nɔpɛ ge la ná tɔun polu. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Nu nɛɛ ʋɛ mu ga è-yii pɛ, ɗa-ɠeleɠelegi pɛ, è-zuvikɛi pɛ, ta è è-zeiɲɔɠɔi nɛɛ ʋɛ, eɠɛ ɗa ɓɔɠɔi, naa vizɔgɛ gala zalaɠaiti ta zalaɠaiti pɛ ba.»<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>Yesu kaai ma ga zunui gooɠaaʋote pagɔi veeʋɛ, é ɠɛni ma: «È maa la ɠoozani GALA ná-masadai ʋa.» Naa ʋoluma, tanɔpɛ zii la mɔ ɠɛni lɔɔzu, é ʋa gaazaɠa.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilista ta Davide ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matiyo 22:41-46</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luke 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Tɛi Yesu ɠɛni kalagi wosu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, é gaazaɠagi woni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Toɠa ɠale, tɔ kalamɔinti ti Kilista lolisu ga Davide mavofodai? <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai puuni Davide ɓɔɠɔi yiimaʋɛ, é ɗa ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‹Maliɠii GALA ge ɠɛni Màliɠii ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Zei zèezazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">eyɛsu gè è zili nuiti da è ɠɔɠɔwu.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Guy 110:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>Davide ɓɔɠɔi ɠa tolisu ga tɔun Maliɠii, é leʋe ɠale mu, é ɗa ɠɛ ga naa mavofodai?» Bɛbɛi ɠɛni woilosu Yesu woo ma ga ɠoozunɛ ʋele.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔ kalamɔinti ta-ʋeelalai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matiyo 23:1-36</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luke 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Siɛgi zu é ɠɛni kalagi wosu da, é ɠɛni ti ma: «À dama ga tɔ kalamɔinti, niiti ti-yiimai ga ti ɗa ziɛziɛ seɠe wolaiti su, ta ti wɔinɗai ga ti ɗa ti luʋɔ kɛlɛmaʋɛti. <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/>Lɛbiya zeizuʋɛti nɛai ti ʋɛ GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu, ta seizu ʋagɔiti fɛti laami wosuʋɛti. <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/>Ti ɗa poanzaiti kɔligiti kula ti ya, ti ɗa GALA fali zuɠoozagiti kɛ, nii a kɛ nuɓusɛiti ti ʋa ɗa ti ɠa. Ta-ʋeelalai wola ɠa ɲɔu ti ma.»<verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Poanzai ná-GALA kɔɔi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luke 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Naa ʋoluma Yesu zeini GALA kɔɔ aniɲakai letemaʋɛ, é ɗa nuiti pɛtɛ, niiti ti ɠɛni walii lɔɔzu su. É naavolo nu mɔinmɔin kaani, ti wali mɔinmɔin dɔai su. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Poanzai gila ge ʋaani, nii é ɠɛni ga bala nui. É wali ɠae go felegɔ lɔɔni su, nii tosu wola la ba. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Yesu ná-kaladopoiti tolini, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, poanzai tɛi é ga bala nui, é feeʋɛ é leʋe naati pɛ ba, ti walii lɔai GALA kɔɔ aniɲakai zu. <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔiti ti waliiti feeʋɛ, nii ti ɓɛdɛ la ɠɛa ba. Kɛlɛ tɔun anɛɛ balagɛ, é kɔnɔgi pɛ feeʋɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠoloɠolo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matiyo 24:1-2</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luke 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Siɛgi zu Yesu ɠɛni ɠulazu la GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, ná-kaladopo ɠila ge ɠɛni ma: «Kalamɔn, wɛlɛ lɛɛ! Kɔtui niiti papagɛ ɗɛ! Pɛlɛi nii lo pelei ʋagɛ ɗɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa pɛlɛ wolai niiti kaazu, kɛlɛ ma ɠɔtui gila kpalaa ge la yɛga laani bɔɔla maazu, ti pɛ ta lokasu.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maanɔɠɔiti ta faaɓaagiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matiyo 24:3-14</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luke 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Naa ʋoluma é liini, é zei Wolive wulu ɓelei ma ɠizei ma, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi letemaʋɛ. Piyɛlɛ, Zake, Zan, naa ʋɛɛ Andelé ʋa, ti gaazaɠani yɛ, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>«Bo dɛɛ gi ma, yeelɛ ɠa naama vai ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu la? Naa ʋoluma poogi ma ɓɛgele ɠa nu a kwɛɛ da ga naama vaiti ta ga ʋa ɠɛɛzu?»<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Yesu ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «À dama, nu nɔpɛ ge mina wo ɠaka. <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/>Nu mɔinmɔin ka kpɛtɛ ɠisu ga ti ʋa dàaseigi zu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma ‹Nà ɠa gè ga Kilista,› ta nu mɔinmɔin kaka. <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/>Siɛgi zu wo kɔɔiti maawoo mɛnisu da, ta kɔɔiti maalugi, à mina ɓɔɠɔ yɛ ziiɓɔlɔi zu. Mazɔlɔɔ kɛni naama vaiti ti ɠɛ, kɛlɛ naa lɛi é ʋa ɠɛ ɠɛɛzu ga gaaɓelagi. <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zii ta ɠa wuzeɠe bɔɔla zii laalɔɠɔma, masadai ta ɠa wuzeɠe bɔɔla masadai laalɔɠɔma. Zou ɓaliiti ta ɠɛ ada mɔinmɔin, ta pulu wolaiti. Kɛlɛ naa ɠa ɠɛ nɔ eɠɛ doun zɔlɔɔ koozuwanai lɔɔzeizuʋɛ.<verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>«Wa ɓɔɠɔi, à dama ga ɓɔɠɔ, tɔɔzei ta ʋaazu liizu ga woye tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛti. Ta wo loɠa GALA dɛbi ʋɛlɛiti bu. Ta wo lo kundiɠiiti ta masagiti kakala nɔ̀un maaʋele ma, nii a kɛ wo zeele wooi wo ti ma. <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/>Kɛni dɛ Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laa ɠa zeelina ziiti pɛ ma. <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/>Siɛgi zu ti liizu la ga woye tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, à mina yiizoolɛ ma yeeluɠɔ ga nii wa bo. Kɛlɛ à naa nɔ wo, nii a ve wo ya naama yeeɠɛɠalai nɔ zu. Tɔɔzei wa lɛi wo ʋa ɠɛ ɓɔɛzu, kɛlɛ Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠa a ɓɔɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>Ɠɛɛɠɛloin ɠa kɛɛɠɛloin leʋe ga ti paa, doun kɛɛɠɛi ɠa ná-doin leʋe ga ti paa. Dointi ta wuzeɠe ti zɔlɔɔ nuiti daalɔɠɔma, ti ti lɔ saai zu. <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ka wo wɔinzeɠe nɔ̀un maaʋele ma. Kɛlɛ zɔi a lo kpaan eyɛsu gaaɓelasuʋɛ zeeli, naa ɠa ɠizo.»<verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faa ɲɔu maayikiyikigi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matiyo 24:15-28</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luke 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>«Siɛgi zu wo kɔzɔba vaa wolai ɠaazu la, é ɗa ɠɛ ʋɛ maa la nɛɛni, é ʋa ɠɛ ná»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɛlɛ ʋɛti: <char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char>.</char></note> (zɔi é sɛʋɛi nii ɠalasu, naama nui dama, é gaaɠa ga pagɔ), «naama yeeɠɛɠalai, zɔiti ta ɠɛ Zudé, naati ti ʋela, ti lɛ gizeiti ma. <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/>Ni nui ta a ɠɛna dooɠo bosuʋɛ ná-pɛlɛ ɠɔmaʋɛ, é mina yei ɠasɔ zeɠezu pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/>Zɔi ɓalaagi a ɠɛ kpalagaʋɛ, naa mina ɠale ma lɛɛzu taazu, ná-seɠe wolai zeɠe vai zu. <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/>Naama voloiti su, maanɔɠɔi ɠa ɠɛ koma anzanuiti bɛ ta zɔiti ti ɲiimi veezu! <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/>À GALA maanɛɛnɛ ga niima vaiti ti mina ɠɛ ga samai. <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/>Tɔɔzei naama ziɛgi zu, kidaaʋiligi wola ɠa ɲɔu, nii kaipa GALA ge eteai ɓɛtɛni, kɛɠala la dɛ ɠɛɛni, nii eyɛsu ɠɔ nu la mɔ kɛɠala ɠa pɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>Gaamazu, ni Maliɠii la ɠɛni deveni ga é ta ɠula naama voloiti tiegɔi la, nu nɔpɛ ge la ɓena ɠizo. Kɛlɛ nui niiti é yiimazeɠeai ga tiye, naati maaʋele ma, é ta ɠulaʋɛ naama maanɔɠɔi ma yeeɠɛɠalai la. <verse eid="MRK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/>Ni nui ta a ɠɛɛna wo ma: ‹À wɛlɛ, Kilista ɠa ʋɛ!›, ɓaa: ‹À wɛlɛ, toɠa munu!›, à mina la da. <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/>Zɛɛ Kilistaiti ta zɛɛ ɠala goo wo nuiti ta ʋaazu ɠulazu kɛlɛma, ti ɗa laavɔɔ vaiti ta maaɓɛlɛ vaiti kɛ, nii a kɛ ti nuiti yaava, ni toɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu, ti naati yaava, niiti GALA ge yiimazeɠeai ga tiye. <verse eid="MRK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>Wɔun, à dama ga ɓɔɠɔ, tɔɔzei gè wo loa ɠisu fai pɛ su ma yeeluɠɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nu ná-Doun Zunui ʋaa vai ʋolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matiyo 24:29-31</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luke 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>«Kɛlɛ naama voloiti su, kidaaʋiligi ma ziɛgi a leʋena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 13:24">foloi zu ɠa ɓidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 13:24">alugi la mɔ ná-wozakalagi vea.<verse eid="MRK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>Somideɠaiti ta ɠula geeɠɔlɔgi ʋa, ti loo bu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 13:25">geeɠɔlɔgi zu zɛbɛiti ta ɲiikpi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Eza 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:4">34:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Zow 2:10</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>«Naazu, ta ʋaazu Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠaazu, é ɗa ʋa tonaɓiingiti maazu ga zɛbɛ wolai ta lɛbiyai. <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/>Toɠa ná-geezuɠeelaiti teʋe eteai ɠɔlɔkɔlɔma ná pɛ, ti ná-nuiti gaalɛ ba, niiti é yiimazeɠeai ga tiye, é zo zou ɓela ga, é li zou ɓela ga.»<verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalagi nu a sɔlɔɔ kooleɠoole gului ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matiyo 24:32-35</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luke 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>«Kooleɠoole gului ná-poogi ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga kalagi: Siɛgi zu ma ɓekegiti ti ɠɛɛzu la yɔɠɔɓɔ, gaalaagi ma lɛnugiti ti ɗa lɛ ga, wo kwɛni naazu ga foɠoi maaɓuɠaa. <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/>Ʋele nɔ ɠana é la, siɛgi zu wo niima vaiti kaazu la, ti ɗa ɠɛ, à kwɛɛ ga Nu ná-Doun Zunui maaɓuɠaa pɛlɛlaʋɛ ʋa. <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, yamanii nii la ɓega ga leʋe, eyɛsu niima vaiti pɛ ti ɗa ɠɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/>Geeɠɔlɔgi ta zooi ta leʋe, kɛlɛ nɔ̀un daawooiti ti la leʋega pɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA gila kpe ka é etea ɠaaɓela foloi ɠwɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matiyo 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>«Nii é ga foloi ta yeeɠɛɠalai nii naama vai ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu la, nu nɔpɛ ge la naa ɠwɛɛ. Geezuɠeelaiti ti la kwɛɛ, Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɓɔɠɔi ɓalaa ge la kwɛɛ, kɛni Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA gila kpe nɔ ɠa é kwɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>À wɛlɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma, wo ɠaazuɓa, tɔɔzei wo la yeeɠɛɠalai ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/>Faiti ta ɠɛ eɠɛ nui ta a ɠula ná-pɛlɛi wu, é ɗa li siɛ ɠooza ma, é zɛba é botii ve ná-botiɠɛ nuiti zea, é ɛsɛ gilagilagi losu ve zea. É devei veeni pɛlɛla makɛ nui ya, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Wɛlɛ ná ma.› <verse eid="MRK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>À ɠaazuɓa mu, tɔɔzei wo la kwɛni, yeei pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi ʋaazu la. Ɓaa toɠa ʋa ga kpɔkɔi, ɓaa kua zaamai, ɓaa tɛɛ zinɛi a ɓɔɛna, ɓaa sobuzobui? Wo la naa ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/>Ni a ʋaana ga kulafilibai, maa la nɛɛni é ʋa wo ɠa ɲiizu. <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/>Nii ɠani gè bosu wo ma, nà bosu ɛsɛ pɛ ma: À ɠaazuɓa!»<verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yaavai ɠili vai Yesu ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matiyo 26:1-5</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luke 22:1-2</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Zan 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>É yɛni ga folo felegɔ <char style="w">Pakegi</char> ta ɓului nii lɛʋɛ la su, naama vɛtiiti ti zeeli. Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta tɔ kalamɔinti ti ɠɛni keleɠele gaiziɛzu ga ti Yesu zo dɔɔɠuzu, ti paa. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Kɛni ade mina kɛ fɛtii zu, nii a kɛ ade mina wutu teʋe bɛbɛi zaama.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ziɛ vai Yesu ma <optbreak/> Ɓetani taazuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matiyo 26:6-13</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Zan 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Yesu ɠɛni Ɓetani, gee nu wɔlɔmai Simon ná-pɛlɛi wu. Siɛgi zu Yesu ɠɛni la daamii wosu, anzanui ta ʋaani, goolei ɠɛni zoni zea, kpɛtɛai ga aaleɓatelegi, daavegai ga naale kitei ma wulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi, nii sɔngɔi wola ɓaai. É goolei ɠoloni, é gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ʋu Yesu nɔungi zu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Naa wanani nui tanigaa ma, ti ɗa unsuɓɔɛi wo yɔɠɔzu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu é gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi nii ɠoloɠolosu? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Nu a la zoo gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi nuu ʋɔdizu, è wali ɠae unsaʋagɔ (300) zɔlɔɔ ba, é ve bala nuiti zea.» Ti ɠɛni zelii losu anzanui ma ga gola.<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «À zɛ ná dɔin! Lee vaa zu wo kpɔlɔzu? Faa ʋapa gola ɠa é kɛa bɛ̀. <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/>Bala nuiti ta wo ʋa yeenɔpɛ, wa zoo wo faanɛɛ ɠɛ ti ʋɛ, yeei wo pɔ la, kɛlɛ nɔ̀un gè la ʋaazu yɛsu wo ʋa yeenɔpɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/>Anzanui tɛi ge naa ɠɛɛʋɛ, nii ma zobogi bɛ. É gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ziaa kɔ̀lɔgi ma, nii a kɛ é màaɠulu vai ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ma yeeluɠɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, ʋɛ nɔpɛ Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelizu ná eteai zu ná pɛ, nii ɓalaa anzanui nii kɛai, naa laa ɠa zeeli, é ɠɛ ga ɠizɛsui ná-faa zu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zudase yeezei vai Yesu yaava vai wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matiyo 26:14-16</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luke 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Naama vaiti poluma, keela puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12) ɠila, daa ga Zudase Isekaliyɔte, naa liini zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti pɔ bɛ, nii a kɛ é Yesu lɔ ti yeezu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Nii é boni ti ma, naa nɛɛni ti ʋɛ, ti minazeɠe bɛ ga ti wali ve zea. É zo naazu ma niina, é ɠɛni yeeɠɛɠala ʋagɔ ɠaiziɛzu ga é Yesu lɔ ti yeezu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ta ná-kaladopoiti ti Pake daamii wo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matiyo 26:17-25</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luke 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Zan 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Ɓului nii lɛʋɛ la su, naama vɛtii ma volo mɔungi, yeei ta ɗa <char style="w">Pakegi</char> ma ʋaala ziʋoi ʋaa la, Yesu ná-kaladopoiti ti gaazaɠani, ti ɠɛ ma: «Mini ɠa è pɔ ga gi Pake daamii ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ná è ʋɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>É zɛba é kaladopo felegɔ zeɠe ti zaama, é ti leʋe, é vali ti ma ɠani: «À li taazuʋɛ, wa ɠomisu wa zunui ta, ziɛ liɠii unma. À ʋilɛ polu. <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/>Ʋɛ nɔpɛ é lɛɛzu ná, à ɠɛ pɛlɛ kɛɛ nui naa ma: ‹Kalamɔn ɠɛ: Pɛlɛi ɠa mini, ʋɛ gè ʋaazu Pake daamii wosu ná, gá nà-kaladopoiti?› <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/>Zunui naa ɠa geezu ʋɛlɛ wolai wu lɛɛzu ga woye, ʋɛ ná wuuɓɛtɛai. Miná ɠa wa kɛʋele ɓɛtɛi ɠɛ ná ade ʋɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Kaladopoiti ti liini taazuʋɛ, ti fai pɛ kaani nɔ ga ʋelei Yesu boni la ti ma. Ti Pake daamii ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Kpɔkɔi zeeliai ma, Yesu ʋaani ta keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12). <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni zeini la taɓalii ɠakala, ti ɗa daamii wo, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, wo ɠila nii é daamii wosu pɔ̀, naa ɠa ʋaazu tèʋesu sìli nuiti pɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Naama wooi kaladopoiti gola yiiɓɔlɔni. Ti ɠɛni gaazaɠasu ga seɠezeɠedai, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nà ʋe mu ɓaa?»<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>É ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo nu puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12) ɠila be, nii gi yeelɔɔzu ɓɔni ɠilagi zu gá tɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/>Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠa za, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la GALA sɛʋɛiti su, é lo tɔun ba. Kɛlɛ maanɔɠɔi ɠa naama nui luɠɔ, nii é ʋaazu Nu ná-Doun Zunui lɔɔzu sili nuiti zeezu. A la vizɔ ma nui ma ga é mina vɔlɔ zɔlɔɔ pɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maliɠii ná-Pake daamii ɠaaɓelagi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matiyo 26:26-30</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luke 22:14-20</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolɛnte 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni daamii wosu da, Yesu ɓului zeɠeni. Kpegai ma ga mama fee ƓALA falii wo, é galeɠaleni, é fe ti ya, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À seɠe, nii ɠa é ga kpùsɛi.»<verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ziawɔi ta zeɠeni. Kpegai ma ga mamagi ve GALA bɛ, é feeni ti ya. Ti pɛ ti ɓɔɔleni la. <verse eid="MRK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Nii ɠa é ga mà ɲamai, nii é minazeɠegi laazeelizu. Tɔ ɠa puai nu mɔinmɔin bɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/>Gè bo wo ma ga gaamai, gè la mɔ ansaɠɔ gwaai ma ɗɛi ta ɓɔlea pɛ, eyɛsu foloi nà kpɔle la ga niinɛ, GALA ná-masadai zu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Ti ɓegai ma ga guyei loo, ti ɠulani, ti li Wolive wulu ɓelei ma ɠizei ma.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu bo fai ga Piyɛlɛ ɠa ʋaazu ɠɛlɛzu ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matiyo 26:31-35</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luke 22:31-34</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Zan 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Wo pɛ wa ʋaazu ɠɛlɛzu bà, mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: ‹Nà ʋaazu baala makɛ nui loɠazu, naazu baalagiti su ɠa vaza.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zkl 13:7</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu gè wuzeɠezu la, gè ɠula saai ya, nà tosu da wo luɠɔ Galilé yooi zu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni ma: «Anɛɛ ni zɔiti pɛ ta ɠɛlɛzu è ʋa, nɔ̀un nà laade!» <verse eid="MRK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Yesu ɠɛni ma: «Gè bo è ma ga gaamai, za kpidii nɔ, tɛɛ zinɛi ʋa ɠɛ é ɓɔɛ ga seizu felegɔ, ɗa ʋaazu ɠɛlɛzu bà ná zeizu ɠɛ saʋa.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ sakpeni ga zɛbɛi, é ɠɛ ma: «Anɛɛ ɓalaa da zaazu ʋɔɔma, naa ɠa ɠɛ, kɛlɛ gè la ɠɛlɛa è ʋa pɛ.» Zɔiti pɛ ti lɛɛni ga naama woo ɠilagi nɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu GALA fali vai Gɛtɛsemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matiyo 26:36-46</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luke 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Ti zeelini adaʋɛ ta, ʋɛ ná laaseigi ga Gɛtɛsemane. Yesu ɠɛni ná-kaladopoiti ma: «À zei ʋɛ, siɛgi zu gè GALA falizu la.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>É zɛba é Piyɛlɛ zeɠe ta Zake, naa ʋɛɛ Zan ʋa. É tɔɔzeini ga é ziizoolɛi ɠaaɠa ɠɔlɔ su, ziiɓɔlɔ wolai ʋili ma. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Ziiɓɔlɔi ʋooʋa zìimaʋɛ ma, eyɛsu é ɠɛ é pàa. À yɛ ʋɛ, wo ɠaazuɓa.»<verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>É lago liini fɔɛn luɠɔ, é laaʋɛ zooi ma, é GALA fali ga ni toɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu, kpɔlɔi naa ma yeeɠɛɠalai maaɠooza ba, <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>é ɠɛni ma: «Ee, Aɓa, Kɛ̀ɛ, ɗɔun ɗa zoo fai pɛ kɛɛzu, soolɛi ma ɗaawɔi nii maaɠooza bà. Kɛlɛ anɛɛ naa ʋe, zìima vai mina ɠɛ, kɛni ɗɔnɔi nɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>É ɠaleni ma kaladopoiti pɔ bɛ, é ti ɠa ɲiizu. É ɠɛni Piyɛlɛ ma: «Simon, ɗa ɲiizu? È la zooni è ʋa lɛlɛ ɠila gaazuɓa wo! <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/>À ɠaazuɓa, wo GALA fali, wo mina ʋa loozu tɛgai zu. Nui yɛnvui laavegɛ ga kisiɛ ʋagɔiti, kɛlɛ zɛbɛ la kpusɛi ʋa.»<verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>É maaɠoozani mɔnɔ ga é GALA fali, é ɗa lɛ woo ɠilagi nɔ ma. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>É ɠaleni ma ʋolu, é kaladopoiti ka ɲiizu, tɔɔzei ɲiimɛnii ɓɔini ti la ga gola. Ti la ɠɛni kwɛɛni, ʋelei ta gooɠaaʋote da. <verse eid="MRK 14:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Siɛgi zu é ʋaani la siɛ laa zaʋasiɛi zu, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Wa dɛ ɲiizu, wo ɗa looɠo? É ɓega, yeeɠɛɠalai zeelia, Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠana ʋa lɔɔzu kotoba nuiti zeezu. <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/>À wuzeɠe, ade li. Zɔi é yàavazu, wɛlɛ ba, é ʋaazu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matiyo 26:47-56</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luke 22:47-53</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Zan 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Yesu ɠɛni dɛ ɓɔɛzu, eyɛsu Zudase ɗa unkula, nii é ɠɛni ga keela puugɔ maazu felegɔi (12) ɠila. Bɛbɛi ɠɛni polu, boɠa zɔkpɔiti ta kpekpe kpuɠaiti ti zoni ti ya. Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti, ta tɔ kalamɔinti, naa ʋɛɛ totuɠɔiti ba, naati ka ti bɛbɛi naa leʋeni.<verse eid="MRK 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Yaava nui Zudase poo gila dɛɛni ga tiye, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Zɔi nɔpɛ gè nɛɛnɛzu, gè laaʋɛ komaga, tɔ ɠana, à so, wo lii la, wo ɓaa maazu ga pagɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Siɛgi zu Zudase ʋaani la, é sakpani nɔ Yesu ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Kalamɔn!» É nɛɛnɛni ga daaʋɛ komagai. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Naa ʋoluma, zɔiti ti yeeʋɛɛni Yesu ma, ti so. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Kɛlɛ niiti ti ɠɛni náʋɛ, naa ɠila ge ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠulani ma laɠagi zu, é pili zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ná-duɔi ma, é naa woii leʋe ba.<verse eid="MRK 14:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Yesu ɠɛni ti ma: «Wo ʋaaʋɛ nɔ̀un so fai zu ga boɠa zɔkpɔiti ta kpekpe kpuɠaiti, eɠɛ toosu nu zo faa? <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/>Folo-o-folo gè ɠɛa wo ʋa GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, gè ɗa nà-kalagi ve, wo la sòni názu. Kɛlɛ niima vaiti pɛ kɛɛʋɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu wooiti daazeeli.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Naa ʋoluma, ná-siɛpoluiti pɛ ti zeɠeni koba, ti ʋela.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Zinipoi ta ʋilɛni polu, ti ɗa li, nii pɛɛma zeɠei nɔ veleveleni ma. Ti soni, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>kɛlɛ é pɛɛma zeɠei looni ya, é ʋela ga maaɲakai.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠɛɛ vai tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti kakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matiyo 26:57-68</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luke 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Zan 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Ti liini ga Yesu zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ná-koizuʋɛ, ʋɛ zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti, naa ʋɛɛ totuɠɔiti ta tɔ kalamɔinti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba ná. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Piyɛlɛ ʋilɛni polu ɠoozama, eyɛsu ti zeeli zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ná-koizuʋɛ. É ɠɛni zeini salaʋusuiti koba abu maaʋɛ, ti ɗa ɠɔɔlɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti ti ɠɛni zeeleiti gaiziɛzu Yesu laalɔɠɔma, nii a kɛ ti tukpɔɠaaleʋe ga é za. Kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni zeele zɔlɔɔsu. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Tɔɔzei nu mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni ná, niiti ti ɠɛni zɛɛ zeele wooiti bosu Yesu laalɔɠɔma, kɛlɛ naama zeele wooi tanɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni ʋilɛsu pele ma ga pagɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Gaaɓelasu, tanigaa ti wuzeɠeni, ti zɛɛ zeele wooi nii wo daalɔɠɔma, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>«Gi goomɛnini, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Nà GALA sei ʋɛlɛi nii ɠolozu, nii togai ga nu yeei, naa ʋoluma folo saʋagɔ laawu gè taɠili to, nii é la loni ga nu yeei.› » <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Kɛlɛ anɛɛ naama wooi ɓalaa su, ti pɛ ti woo la ɠɛni liini ga pele ɠila.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai wuzeɠeni, é Yesu ɠaazaɠa. É ɠɛni ma: «È la nuu tanɔpɛ gaaʋotesu, nii niima nuiti ti bosu è laalɔɠɔma?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu maaɠɛni kpɔ, é la gaaʋoteni. Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai gaazaɠani ʋolu, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa è ga Kilista ɓaa, GALAGI nii mamagi bɛ, naa ná-Doun Zunui?»<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ungo, nà ʋe. Wa ʋaazu Nu ná-Doun Zunui ɠaazu, é zeini Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii yeezazuʋɛ, é ɗa ʋa geeɠɔlɔgi ma lonaɓiingiti maazu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai zɛba é ɠɔba zeɠeiti baliʋali ga, kidaaʋiligi maaʋele ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Zeele ɓɛgele ɠa ade ɓɛdɛi ba niina? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Wo woo ɲɔi nii mɛniga GALA daalɔɠɔma! Wa ɠisiɛzu ɠale?» Ti pɛ ti peelalani naazu, ti ɠɛ maanɛɛʋɛ ga é za.<verse eid="MRK 14:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Tanigaa ti tɔɔzeini ga ti ɗa laaɗɛi ʋili ma, ti ɗa gaazuʋɛ ɠili, ti ɗa doɠa, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Naama nui lɛ ga giye, zɔi é è loɠaai!» Salaʋusuiti ti Yesu zoni, ti ɗa goizuloɠa.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛlɛ ɠɛlɛ vai Yesu ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matiyo 26:69-75</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luke 22:56-62</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Zan 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, Piyɛlɛ ɠɛni buu ʋelei, koi zaamaʋɛ. Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ná-botiɠɛ anzanu ɠila ge ʋaani, <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>é Piyɛlɛ ɠa, é ɗa ɠɔɔlɛ, é ɠaazulo naa ʋa, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɓalaa è ɠɛni Yesui tɛi ba, Nazalɛte nui nii!» <verse eid="MRK 14:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Kɛlɛ Piyɛlɛ zeɠeni ga, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè la kwɛni. Nii è bosu, gè la ɓalaa naa ɠaaɠaazu.» Naa ʋoluma é ɠulani koizuʋɛ, é li ga nu lɛɛzu ʋelei. [Gaamago tɛɛ zinɛi ɓɔɛni.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Kɛlɛ botiɠɛ anzanui kaani, é tɔɔzei ʋolu ga ɠɛa niiti ma, ti ɠɛni ná: «Nii ɓalaa ka ga ti ta.» <verse eid="MRK 14:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Piyɛlɛ zeɠeni ga mɔnɔ. Ná tago kɛai ma, niiti ti ɠɛni Piyɛlɛ ma ʋolu: «Gaamazu, ɗa ga niima nuiti ti ta. Mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ga Galilé nu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Gè ɠonaa, GALA ge dòɠa, ni zɛɛ ɠa gè bosu, gè la zunui nii ɠwɛɛ, nii wo vaazu ma!» <verse eid="MRK 14:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Gaamago nɔ, tɛɛ zinɛi ɓɔɛni mɔnɔ ná zeizu velesiɛi. Piyɛlɛ ɠigi looni naama wooi zu, nii Yesu boni ma ga: «Tɛɛ zinɛi ʋa ɠɛ é ɓɔɛ ga seizu felegɔ, ɗa ʋaazu ɠɛlɛzu bà ná zeizu ɠɛ saʋa.» É wɔlɔni ga gola.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠɛɛ vai Pilate ɠakala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matiyo 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luke 23:1-5</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Zan 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Sobuzobui, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ta totuɠɔiti, naa ʋɛɛ tɔ kalamɔinti ba, ta tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolai mɔtaiti ba, ti gaalɛba ɠɛɛni, ti deve wo. Ti Yesu ɠilini, ti lii la, ti dɔ Pilate yeezu. <verse eid="MRK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Pilate gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɠa è ga Zuifuiti ta-masagi?» Yesu gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è boga.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ti ɠɛni maalɔɔzu ga faa mɔinmɔin. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Pilate gaazaɠani ʋolu, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗɔun è la gooɠaaʋote feezu? Maalɔɔi pɛ ti bosu è laalɔɠɔma, ɗa ti mɛnisu nɛi?» <verse eid="MRK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Kɛlɛ Yesu la mɔ ɠɛni gooɠaaʋoteni. Naa ɠa é Pilate laavɔɔni.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zaa vai leve vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matiyo 27:15-26</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luke 23:13-25</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Zan 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Pake fɛtii ɠula laa ɠilagila, Pilate ɓena kasoɠa nu ɠila pilɛ bɛbɛi ʋɛ, nii nɔpɛ a la maavalina. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>Tama naama ziɛgi zu, zunui ta ɠɛni kasoi ɠa wutu teʋe nuiti saama, daaseigi ga Ɓalaɓase, ti soni, tɔɔzei nu ʋaa vai ʋa, wutugi ta zu. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Bɛbɛi ʋaani zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii ná-koizuʋɛ, ti faaɓɔɠɔi naa zuvali Pilate ma, nii a ɗa kɛ ti ʋɛ pɔlɔma.<verse eid="MRK 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Pilate ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Wa pɔ ga gè Zuifuiti ta-masagi ʋilɛ wo ʋɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é suɠwɛɛni ga toloi maaʋele nɔ ɠa é kɛa, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ti Yesu leʋega la pɔ. <verse eid="MRK 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Kɛlɛ zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ti lɔɔni bɛbɛi unsu ga naati ti Ɓalaɓase ʋilɛ fai zuvali.<verse eid="MRK 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Pilate ti ɠaazaɠani ʋolu, é ɠɛ ma: «Lee ɠa mu nà kɛ ga nii wo tolisu ga Zuifuiti ta-masagi?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Ti wooɠulani ʋolu, ti ɠɛ ma: «Kpadɔ saa wului ma!»<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Pilate ɠɛni ti ma: «Faa ɲɔi ɓɛgele ɠa é kɛai?» Kɛlɛ tɔun ti ɠɛni wola ɓainsu sɛsɛ, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Kpadɔ saa wului ma!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Tɛi Pilate ɠɛni pɔ ga é bɛbɛi yiima vai ɠɛ, é Ɓalaɓase ʋilɛ ti ʋɛ. É devei veeni ga ti Yesu loɠa ga kpakɔi. Naa ɓegai ma, é teʋeni ti ʋɔ kpadɔ vai zu saa wului ma.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲɛɛɠulasui nii salaʋusuiti ti kɛɛni ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matiyo 27:27-31</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Zan 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Salaʋusuiti ti liini ga Yesu zou zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii ná-koizuʋɛ, ti salaʋusu ɓulugi pɛ gaalɛ ba. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Ti zɛba ti seɠe ɓɔi golai ta loo kɔba. Ti ɠaingi vɛlɛni ga masa bɔɔlɔgi, ti dɔ unma. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Naa ʋoluma ti tɔɔzei ga ti ɗa laali ma, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa ná, ee, Zuifuiti ta-masagi!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Ti ɠɛni doɠazu nɔungi zu ga seeli kpakui, ti ɗa laaɗɛi ʋili ma, ti ɗa ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa ga ti nɔkɔ bu. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Ti ɓegai ma ga ɲɛɛɠula su, ti seɠe wola ɓɔigi ɠulani kɔba, ti ná-seɠeiti too kɔba, ti ɠula la ga ti kpadɔ saa wului ma.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓadɔ vai saa wului ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matiyo 27:32-44</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luke 23:26-43</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Zan 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Zunui ta ɠɛni zeɠezu kpalagaʋɛ, Silɛne nu ɠɛni de, daaseigi ga Simon, é ga Alɛgezandele ta Lufuse ti-ɠɛɛ. Ti kɛɛni zea ga maaɓaa vaa ga kɛni é Yesu zaa wului zeɠe. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Ti liini ga Yesu adɛ ta, ʋɛ ná laaseigi ga Gɔlegota (nii poluʋɛ ga «unkala adaʋɛ»). <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Ti dɔɔi veeni zea, nii supuai ga miilegi, kɛlɛ é la kɛɛni, é ʋa ta ɓɔle. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Ti kpadɔni saa wului ma. Naa ʋoluma ti ná-seɠeiti gaaɠwɛɛni ʋa ga kpakutoomai, ti ʋa kwɛɛ, nii ɛsɛ ka sɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Sobu lɛlɛi laaʋuusiɛi ma ɠa ti kpadɔni la saa wului ma. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Sɛʋɛi nii é ɠɛni saa ungi lɛɛzu, é zɛʋɛni naa zu ga «Zuifuiti ta-masagi». <verse eid="MRK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Ti ti ɓadɔni ʋɔɔma saa wuluiti ma ta toosu nu felegɔ, gilagi ɠɛni zeezazu ʋelei, zɔi ɠɛ kɔʋɛzu ʋelei. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>[Ʋele ɠana GALA Sɛʋɛi wooi ʋilɛni la su ga: «Ti gaalugɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti saama.»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni leʋesu ga ná ʋelei, naati ti ɠɛni ungi ɲiikpisu, ti ɗa poomu, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Koo! Ɗɛi è GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠolozu, è to ʋolu folo saʋagɔ laawu, <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>ɓɔɠɔ ɠizona, è ɠula saa wului ma, è yei!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠiiti ɓalaa, naa ʋɛɛ tɔ kalamɔinti ba, ti ɠɛni ɲɛɛɠulazu su ɓɔɠɔ zaama, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «É zɔiti kizoga, kɛlɛ é la zooga é ʋa ɓɔɠɔ ɠizo! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Tɛigi é ga Kilista, Izilayɛle masagi, é yei na, é ɠula saa wului ma, gi ka, gá la da naazu!» Zɔiti ɓalaa ti ti ɓadɔni ʋɔɔma saa wuluiti ma ta tiye, ti ɠɛni ɲɛɛɠulazu su.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu zaa vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matiyo 27:45-56</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luke 23:44-49</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Zan 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Foloi gaalɔgai ma, kpidii ʋɛɛni zooi zu ná pɛ, eyɛsu lɛlɛi zaʋasiɛi ma kpɔkɔ voloi. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Kpɔkɔ volo lɛlɛi zaʋasiɛi ma, Yesu kpee looni ga woo wola, é ɠɛ ma: «Eloyi, Eloyi, lama saɓaketani?» (nii poluʋɛ ga «Nà-GALAGI, nà-GALAGI, lee vaa zu è ɠɛlɛa bà?»).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:2">Guy 22:2</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Siɛgi zu ti naama wooi mɛnini da, zɔiti ti ɠɛni ná, naa tanigaa ti ɠɛni ma: «Wɛlɛ, toɠa Eli lolisu.» <verse eid="MRK 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Gila ge ɓizɛni, é seɠe ɓuɠai lɔ dɔɔ ɓodai wu, é gili seeli kpakui ʋa, é tete Yesu ma ga naa kpɔle, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «À zɛna! Ada ka ni Eli ɠa ʋa, é kula ʋɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Yesu kpee wolai looni, naa ʋoluma niina zii loo.<verse eid="MRK 15:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Názu ɠa kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi nii é ɠɛni zɛlɛni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, naa ʋalini la su fele, é zo ungaʋɛ, é yei buuʋɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Wɔlɔme zalaʋusu ɠundiɠii nii é ɠɛni loni Yesu ɠakala, é naa zaa ʋelei ɠaai ma, é ɠɛni ma: «Gaamazu, zunui nii ɠɛa ga GALA Doun Zunui!»<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Anzanui tanigaa ɓalaa ti ɠɛni loni ɠoozama, ti ɗa wɛlɛ ná ʋa. Naati saama, Magedala nui Mali ɠɛni ná, naa ʋɛɛ Zake goi ta Zoze ti-lee Mali ʋa, ta Salomé. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Tiya ɠa ti ɠɛni Yesu ʋolu, ti ɗa maaleʋebo kaite, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni la Galilé yooi zu. Anzanu mɔinmɔin kiligaa ti ɠɛni ná, niiti ti yɛni polu, ti lɛ Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu maaɠulu vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matiyo 27:57-61</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luke 23:50-56</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Zan 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>Tɛi kpɔkɔ voloi zeelini, dooɠo foloi ma ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ voloi ɠɛni de, nii é ga dooɠo foloi maaɲii, <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>Alimaté taazuʋɛ nui Zozɛfe ʋaani. É ɠɛni ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nu wolaiti ti ɠila, unfema nu wolai ɠɛni de. Tɔ ɓalaa é ɠɛni GALA ná-masadai ʋaa vai maaɓɔunsu kitogi zu. É yiiɓaani, é li Pilate ʋɔ bɛ, é Yesu ma ʋoomai maavali ma. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Pilate laavɔɔni ga é mɛni ga Yesu zaa ɠɛni de niina. É salaʋusu ɠundiɠii lolini, é gaazaɠa ni Yesu zaa ɠɛni de niina. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Tɛi salaʋusu ɠundiɠii kisuɠalani kpoke, é vaani bu ga Zozɛfe Yesu ma ʋoomai zeɠe. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Zozɛfe geze zeɠei ɠeyani, é Yesu ɠula saa wului ma, é maavelevele ga geze zeɠei, é da kabai ta zu, nii bɔai fasai ʋa. Naa ʋoluma, é kɔtu wolai ta ɠilikilini, é da kabai la. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Magedala nui Mali ta Zoze dee Mali ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu, ʋɛ ti Yesu laani ná.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu wuzeɠe vai <optbreak/> é ɠula saai ya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:18-20">Matiyo 28:18-20</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luke 24:1-12</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Zan 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Dooɠo foloi leʋegai ma, Magedala nui Mali, naa ʋɛɛ Zake dee Mali ʋa, ta Salomé, ti tufa maku nɛɛnɛgiti geyani, nii a kɛ ti li, ti siɛ Yesu ma ʋoomai ma. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Dɔɔɠɔi ma volo mɔungi sobuzobui, ti liini kabalaʋɛ, woza seɠezuʋɛ ma. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Ti ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠasu ga: «Ɓɛ ɠa a kɔtui ɠilikili ade ʋɛ, é seɠe kabai la?»<verse eid="MRK 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu ti ɠaazuwuzeɠeni la, ti kaani ga kɔtu zɛbɛlɛ golai ɠilikiligɛ, é zeɠe kabai la. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Ti lɔɔni kabayeɠei zu, ti wɛlɛ, ti zinipoi ta ɠa, é zeini ga nu yeezazu ʋelei, maaɠiliai ga seɠe ɠole pepegi. Ti wola luani.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Kɛlɛ zinipoi ɠɛni ti ma: «À mina lua. Nazalɛte nui Yesu ɠa wo gaiziɛzu, nii ti kpadɔni saa wului ma. É la mɔ ʋɛ, é wuzeɠea, é ɠula saai ya. À ʋa, wo wɛlɛ, ʋɛ é ɠɛa laani ná. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>À li niina, wo bo ná-kaladopoiti ma ta Piyɛlɛ ɓalaa ma, wo ɠɛ ti ma: ‹É toga da wo luɠɔ Galilé yooi zu, miná ɠa wa ka ná, eɠɛʋelei é boni la wo ma.› »<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Ti ɠulani kabayeɠei zu, ti ʋela, tɔɔzei ti zu ɠɛni ɓalizu ga duai. Ti la faa woni nu nɔpɛ ma, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni luazu.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛ vai ga Magedala nui Mali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matiyo 28:9-10</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Zan 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">16:9-20 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Wooi niiti ti [ ] kpaku felegɔiti zɔɠɔzu, naati ti la sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu.</char>
    </note>[Yesu wuzeɠeai ma, é ɠula saai ya dɔɔɠɔi ma volo mɔungi sobui, é ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛni dɛ ga Magedala nui Mali, nii kaite é inɛ dɔfelaiti kpɛɛni su. <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/>Naa liini, é naama wooi wo zɔiti ma, ti ɠɛni ga Yesu ná-siɛpoluiti, ti gaazuɠilii zu, ti ɗa wɔlɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/>Ti mɛnigai ma ga toɠa vulua, ta Mali pɛtɛgɛ, ti la ɠɛni laani da.<verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɠula vai kɛlɛma kaladopo felegɔiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luke 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>Naa ʋoluma é ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛni ga kaladopo felegɔ kɛʋelei taɠili su, naati ti ɠɛni pelei ma, ti ɗa li ɓalaɠai zu. <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/>Naati felegɔ ɓalaa ti ɠaleni ma, ti ʋa ti bo zɔiti ma, kɛlɛ ti la laani ɓalaa naati gooi la.<verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛ vai <optbreak/> ga kaladopo puugɔ maazu ɠilagiti (11)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matiyo 28:16-20</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luke 24:36-49</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Zan 20:19-23</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Kɛɛwotiiti 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>Gaaɓelagi zu, é ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛni ga kaladopo puugɔ maazu ɠilagiti (11), siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni daami wosuʋɛ la. É zeliloni ti ma ta-ɠidaaleʋelalai ta ta-ɠikpaai vai zu, tɔɔzei ti la ɠɛni laani naama nuiti da, niiti ti kaani, buzeɠeai ma, é ɠula saai ya. <verse eid="MRK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>Naa ʋoluma é ɠɛni ti ma: «À li eteai zu ná pɛ, wo Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli nuɓusɛi pɛ ma. <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/>Zɔi a ɠidaaleʋena, é ɓatize, naa ɠa ɠizo, kɛlɛ zɔi é la ɠidaaleʋeni, naa undaa ɠa ʋili. <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/>Wɛlɛ laavɔɔ vai niiti ka ta ʋilɛ naama nuiti polu, ti ʋaazu ɠidaaleʋezu mà: Nɔ̀un daaseigi zu, ta inɛgiti kpɛ, ta ɠɛ ɓɔɛzu zii woo ɠiligiti su, <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/>ta ɠɛ kaaliiti sosu ga yeei, ti nu ʋaa ani ɓɔle ʋa, faa nɔpɛ ge la ti ɠaa, ta yeela seeɓɛ nuiti ma, naati ti ɗa ɠɛdɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lɛɛ vai geeɠɔlɔgi zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luke 24:50-53</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Kɛɛwotiiti 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>Maliɠii Yesu ɓegai ma ga ɓɔɛ ti ʋɔ ɠana, é lɛɛni geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é zei GALA zeezazuʋɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>Kaladopoiti ma ti liini, ti ɗa Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli adɛ pɛ. Maliɠii ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu ga ti maaʋele, é ɗa ti-wooi maaɓakpa ga laavɔɔ vaiti, niiti ti ɠɛni ʋilɛsu ti-wooi ʋolu.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
